  '{"id":"OjHbS-_nncw","title":"🇯🇵 Japan Walking Tour - Discovering Kyoto’s Suburban Streets in 4K HDR 60fps","description":"Welcome to an immersive walking tour through the captivating suburbs of Ukyo, Japan. Join us as we embark on a journey of discovery, exploring the breathtaking moss gardens, enchanting bamboo forests, and awe-inspiring temples and shrines that grace this picturesque region.\n\nAs we stroll through the moss gardens, you''ll be mesmerized by the delicate beauty of the lush green carpets and the tranquil ambiance they create. Feel the serenity wash over you as you immerse yourself in this natural oasis, surrounded by the gentle whispers of nature.\n\nNext, we''ll venture into the mystical bamboo forests, where towering bamboo stalks sway gracefully in the breeze. Lose yourself in the mesmerizing rhythm of nature as sunlight filters through the dense canopy, creating a captivating play of light and shadow.\n\nOur journey continues as we encounter ancient temples and shrines, steeped in rich history and spiritual significance. Experience the palpable sense of reverence as you explore these sacred spaces, adorned with intricate architectural details and adorned with vibrant colors.\n\nThroughout the tour, our knowledgeable guide will provide fascinating insights into the cultural heritage and significance of each location, allowing you to deepen your understanding of Japan''s traditions and customs.\n\nWhether you''re a nature enthusiast, a history buff, or simply seeking a peaceful escape, this walking tour of Ukyo''s suburbs promises to be a transformative experience. So put on your walking shoes and join us on this unforgettable adventure. Subscribe now and hit the notification bell to stay updated with our latest videos. Let''s embark on this incredible journey together!\n\nChapters:\n0:00 Intro\n2:25 Ukyo Ward\n17:34 Japanese House\n26:52 Mossy Garden\n37:44 Sagakameyamacho\n47:50 Seiryo-ji Temple\n51:31 Bamboo Forest Walk\n56:25 Shogaku-ji Temple\n59:41 Arashiyama Bamboo Grove\n1:02:26 Kimono Forest\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nLet''s connect:\n►Subscribe: https://www.youtube.com/c/4KWanderings\n►Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/4kWanderings\n►Twitter: https://twitter.com/17NorthNE\n►Instagram: https://instagram.com/17NNE\n►TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@microwalks\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIntro music produced by Ryan Booth at The JamBooth Recording Studio.\nhttps://thejambooth.wixsite.com/music\nhttps://facebook.com/JamBoothMusic/\n\n#walkingtour #citywalk #travel #japan #tokyowalk #4kwalk","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OjHbS-_nncw/hqdefault.jpg","category":"Walking Tours","channel":"World Wanderings: 4K Walking Tours","channelTitle":"World Wanderings: 4K Walking Tours","channelId":"UCiVH7ncT6ghUKvSpY_e0DNQ","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2023-06-21T13:07:31Z","city":"Kyoto","country":"Japan","duration":"PT1H8M10S","active":true,"embedAvailable":true,"thumbnailValid":true,"chapters":[{"title":"Ukyo Ward","startSeconds":145,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":1054},{"title":"Japanese House","startSeconds":1054,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":1612},{"title":"Mossy Garden","startSeconds":1612,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":2264},{"title":"Sagakameyamacho","startSeconds":2264,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":2870},{"title":"Seiryo-ji Temple","startSeconds":2870,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":3091},{"title":"Bamboo Forest Walk","startSeconds":3091,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":3385},{"title":"Shogaku-ji Temple","startSeconds":3385,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description",