VALUES (
  'JFodCefgbuU',
  'What Happens in Paris on a Friday Evening? Blue Hour from Saint-Germain to Louvre | 4K Paris Walk',
  'Experience a cinematic 4K walking tour in Paris, from golden hour to blue hour along the Seine river. This Paris evening walk takes you through Saint-Germain-des-Prés, the Left Bank, and all the way to the Louvre Pyramid at night.

🌆 This immersive 4K walking tour takes you along a scenic sunset route: Saint-Germain-des-Prés ➔ Rue de Buci ➔ Place Saint-Michel ➔ Seine Lower Quays ➔ Pont Neuf ➔ Institut de France➔ Pont des Arts ➔ The Louvre.

Filmed in late May 2026, it''s the real, unfiltered night atmosphere of Paris. Whether you want to relive wonderful memories of your past Paris trip, prepare a detailed travel itinerary for your upcoming visit, or simply enjoy a relaxing virtual armchair tour of the French capital, this cinematic blue-hour walking tour is perfect for you.

👉 Please turn on CC subtitles for detailed historical backgrounds, cultural stories and little-known fun facts about each landmark along the route.

✨ Highlights:
• Golden hour cafés in Saint-Germain & Rue de Buci
• Historic Left Bank streets & hidden medieval passages
• Seine riverside “apéro” culture at sunset
• JR “The Cave of Pont Neuf” installation (May 2026)
• Blue hour views from Pont des Arts
• Louvre courtyard, glass pyramid & late-night saxophone atmosphere

⏱ Timestamps:
00:00 Boulevard Saint-Germain(Golden Hour Start)
01:18 Rue de Buci(Café Culture & Apéro Hour)
04:13 Rue de Seine
08:19 Café Le Procope – Oldest Café in Paris
11:08 Cour du Commerce Saint-André – Most hidden gem in Saint-Germain
14:58 Rue Saint-André des Arts
22:02 Rue des Hirondelles
24:49 Seine Quays – Notre-Dame View & Blue Hour Begins
26:49 Place Saint-Michel
29:01 Pont Saint-Michel – Sunset Crossing
30:28 Seine Riverbanks – Dinner & Drinks by the Water
35:39 Pont Neuf
41:36 Institut de France
41:42 Pont des Arts – Blue Hour Panorama
44:29 View of JR''s Wrapped Art Masterpiece on Pont Neuf✨
47:24 Walk to the Louvre – The Story of the €88M Crown Jewel Heist
53:06 Louvre Courtyard – Pyramid Night Glow
56:01 Arc de Triomphe du Carrousel
Thank you for walking with me. If you enjoyed this cinematic Paris walk, feel free to like, comment your favorite spot, and subscribe for more real-time 4K walking tours.

