  'nnm6qsXOnEk',
  'ISTANBUL Walking Tour | Turkey Walk Tour with Captions [4K/60fps]',
  'Join us on a captivating walking tour through Istanbul, as we explore the iconic Galata Bridge, the historic Sultanahmet District and the vibrant Galata Quarter. 🎧 Best with headphones for an immersive experience (ASMR - Binaural City Sound). ⬇ LINKS to the full videos, chapters, etc. ⬇

Experience legendary landmarks such as the Hagia Sophia, Blue Mosque, Spice Bazaar, Galata Tower and the lively streets of İstiklal Caddesi during Sacrifice Feast holiday in June. Istanbul, a city where East meets West, has served as the capital of three great empires – Roman, Byzantine and Ottoman, leaving behind a rich tapestry of history, architecture and culture. From the soaring domes of Hagia Sophia to the bustling Grand Bazaar and the vibrant life along the Bosphorus, Istanbul offers an unforgettable journey through the ages. [Filmed in June 2025 during Sacrifice Feast | Kurban Bayramı]

🗺 Google Maps of this tour 👉 https://hpst.me/WT/Istanbul2
i️💁‍♂️ Turn ON the Closed Captions to discover information on attractions, historical facts, and more (Open CC for subtitles). Enjoy!

Watch also:
• Istanbul Sunset Walk 👉 COMING SOON!
• DUBAI Walking Tour 👉 https://youtu.be/I9XB1gHvF74?si=KYGkETdZYffsy0bg
• GIZA PYRAMIDS, Egypt Walking Tour 👉 https://youtu.be/V9HIt9Cbfb0?si=lD5KJVUovVVz-MkT
• EUROPE Walking Tour Playlist (Paris, Rome, Barcelona, etc.) 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL-uSE59HVj4Ah5kaHKApFBm_Wh2mZ_KWd
• ASIA Walking Tour Playlist (Bali, Tokyo, Bangkok, etc.) 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL-uSE59HVj4A2IB8EOMXH6AoGVXoRWVHo
• USA Walking Tour Playlist (Miami, Los Angeles, Las Vegas, NYC, etc.) 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL-uSE59HVj4BUOcpV1xQ_-zNYCA0_CApB

