  'Visit Istanbul, Turkey on this 4K walking tour. 🎧 Best with headphones for an immersive experience. ⬇ LINKS (map, etc.) ⬇

In this video, we''ll take a captivating journey through ISTANBUL, the largest city in Turkey, celebrated as both a cultural and economic epicenter. Situated strategically at the crossroads of Europe and Asia, Istanbul is a mesmerizing metropolis that spans the banks of the Bosphorus Strait. The ancient heart of the city, known as the Old City, bears the indelible marks of diverse cultural legacies left by the numerous empires that have held sway over its rich history.

🗺 Google Maps of this tour 👉 https://hpst.me/WT/Istanbul
i️💁‍♂️ Turn ON the Closed Captions (CC) for info about attractions and other interesting information.
Enjoy! [Recorded July 2023]

Check our other walking tours:
KYOTO, Japan Walking Tour 👉 https://youtu.be/arOQ7slh3pM
