📌 About Istanbul’s Historic Center:
Istanbul is a city where empires once ruled and history is visible at every corner. The Old City combines Byzantine and Ottoman heritage, waterfront scenery, markets, and monumental architecture within walking distance. This 4K Istanbul walking tour captures that diversity naturally, focusing on real street sounds and authentic city life.

🎬 Filming Info:
📍 Location: Istanbul, Türkiye 🇹🇷
📽️ Format: 4K at 60fps
🎧 Audio: Real city sounds – no music, no commentary
☀️ Time: Daytime

Which part of this Istanbul walking tour did you enjoy most – the energy of the Grand Bazaar, the waterfront at Galata Bridge, or the historic atmosphere around Hagia Sophia and the Blue Mosque?

