43:40 Egyptian Bazaar – Spice Bazaar – Mısır Çarşısı
48:40 Eminönü Yeni Camii
52:42 Eminönü Square
55:09 Eminönü Tunnel Shopping
57:03 Famous Place at Eminönü
58:07 Golden Horn – Haliç View
1:02:12 View Point
1:04:18 Galata Bridge
1:12:34 Karaköy

🎬 Filming Info:
📍 Location: Istanbul, Türkiye
📽️ Format: 4K UHD at 60fps
🎧 Audio: Real city sounds – no music, no commentary
☀️ Time: Daytime, September 2025

Which part of this Istanbul walking tour would you enjoy most – exploring Hagia Sophia and the Blue Mosque, shopping at the Grand Bazaar and Spice Bazaar, or walking across the Galata Bridge into Karaköy?

