er Portable Charger : https://amzn.to/3wAMWqv\nApple AirPods Pro (3rd generation) : https://amzn.to/3N9rXqi\nShoes : https://amzn.to/49n5H3X\n\nAll material in this video is original and personally recorded by Julien In NYC. All rights reserved.\nContact : fromlyontonyc@gmail.com","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dXyTpYLvfqE/hqdefault.jpg","category":"Walking Tours","channel":"Julien In NYC","channelTitle":"Julien In NYC","channelId":"UCXdS9jTrUYHPJ2KTWRneHDQ","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2026-07-18T16:00:07Z","city":"New York","country":"United States","duration":"PT58M44S","active":true,"embedAvailable":true,"thumbnailValid":true,"chapters":[{"title":"Spring Street","startSeconds":0,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":315},{"title":"Broadway","startSeconds":315,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":530},{"title":"Prince Street","startSeconds":530,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":700},{"title":"Greene Street","startSeconds":700,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":860},{"title":"Spring Street","startSeconds":860,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":1000},{"title":"West Broadway","startSeconds":1000,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":1160},{"title":"Broome Street","startSeconds":1160,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":1315},{"title":"Greene Street","startSeconds":1315,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":1670},{"title":"Prince Street","startSeconds":1670,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":1730},{"title":"Mercer Street","startSeconds":1730,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":2055},{"title":"Broome Street","startSeconds":2055,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","con