  '{"id":"0AU9_H47w7k","title":"Central Park Walking Tour 🗽 Complete 10-Mile Loop — New York City 4K","description":"A complete walking tour of Central Park — all 10 miles of it. Filmed on a warm\nsummer Sunday, this tour covers nearly every major landmark in the park, from\nthe southern end at Pulitzer Plaza all the way up to the Great Lawn, Belvedere\nCastle, Summit Rock, and back down through Sheep Meadow and the Imagine Mosaic.\n\nIf you''ve ever wanted to explore Central Park without the crowds, this is your walk.\n\n📅 *Filmed on:* Sunday, June 4th, 2023\n🕰 *Start time:* 11:15 AM\n🌞 *Weather* 30°C | 86°F 🌡\n📍 *Location:* Central Park, New York, USA\n📏 *Distance:* 10 Miles\n🗺️ *Map of the Walk:* https://www.google.com/maps/d/edit?mid=1oPqVkNF6DQJ13bXHrNxVutwnjQ7l600&usp=sharing\n\n⏱️ *Video Timeline*\n0:00 Intro and Map\n3:39 Central Park Entrance\n4:55 The Pond\n13:02 Gapstow Bridge\n17:51 Wollman Rink\n24:37 Carousel\n25:21 Baseball Fields\n29:54 Umpire Rock\n*40:23 The Mall*\n48:04 Naumburg Bandshell\n*49:31 Bethesda Terrace*\n1:04:42 Cherry Hill\n*1:06:38 Bow Bridge*\n1:23:01 Conservatory Water\n1:32:06 Glade Arch\n1:33:18 Cedar Hill\n*1:39:23 Belvedere Castle*\n1:48:26 Turtle Pond\n1:53:11 The Great Lawn\n*2:03:56 Shuman Running Track*\n2:35:28 Summit Rock\n2:43:00 American Museum of Natural History\n2:48:44 Hernshead\n3:00:45 Imagine Mosaic — Strawberry Fields\n*3:10:08 Sheep Meadow*\n3:24:40 Dalehead Arch\n3:27:48 Pineback Arch\n\n▶ *Watch Next:*\n\n▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬\n📽 *MORE WALKING TOURS*\n▪Christmas Markets Playlist: (https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLSOO4vYXpMCd2nqHyPaDtgxkf_BsAuQCt&si=0YU1zhv0tLbwm8u6)\n▪ Italy Playlist: (https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLSOO4vYXpMCc6k7EuMhr764qCNeXDrxpj&si=aYfLAtNw1eGc560w)\n▪ Greece Playlist: (https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLSOO4vYXpMCf151n5M3j9IxxvvvZNK7TM&si=xW-ewBTs4pzb90a1)\n▪ Biking Tours Playlist: (https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLSOO4vYXpMCe4SaQXMk9IMfpkl1w473Zz&si=1rFBHTnZtCMmykPA)\n▪ Egypt Playlist: (https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLSOO4vYXpMCc_y7TUiJufW_N_QZod0M8d&si=XgIlOOZb0DLiPt9z)\n▪ Japan Playlist: (https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLSOO4vYXpMCc69vi-SFMODDGKQf_7D-IK&si=hxZIpoG9x1Ypszyq)\n▪ Brazil Playlist: (https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLSOO4vYXpMCcefbIXpStQK7fPRJBBiBAH&si=Zlji0Mfbp3sJlyjs)\n▪ Australia Playlist: (https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLSOO4vYXpMCcuh1sGTbEtCldxhCA6grbV&si=tQ56vSTmsQKUNWjN)\n▪ Complete List of Walks: http://www.prowalks.com/videos\n▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬\n\n===============================================================================\n📢 *SUPPORT & CONNECT:*\n🟥 *Become a Member:* https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNzul4dnciIlDg8BAcn5-cQ/join\n💛 *Patreon:* https://www.patreon.com/Prowalktours\n🌍 *Website:* https://www.prowalktours.com\n📩 *Email:* info@prowalktours.com\n🔔 *Subscribe:* https://www.youtube.com/@ProwalkTours\n💳 *Donate:* https://www.paypal.me/Prowalks\n===============================================================================\n\n▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬\n🎥 *MY FILMING GEAR (SHOP LINKS BELOW!)* 🎥\n🌍 Amazon Storefront: https://www.amazon.com/shop/prowalktours\n🎥Camera: Sony a7siii: https://amzn.to/4hTUSJj\n📸Camera Lens: https://amzn.to/3UtuZUm\n🎬Gimbal: https://amzn.to/3FsDye5\n🎤Microphone: https://amzn.to/3lYW5CI\n🎧In-Ear Monitors: https://amzn.to/2DBdS1D\n▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🏛️ ABOUT CENTRAL PARK\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nCentral Park was designed by Frederick Law Olmsted and Calvert Vaux and opened\nin 1858 as the first major landscaped public park in the United States. This\n843-acre green space was created to give New Yorkers a peaceful escape from the\ncity. Among the highlights: Gapstow Bridge (13:02) offers one of the most iconic\nviews of the Manhattan skyline; Bethesda Terrace (49:31) is often called the\nheart of the park, with intricate Victorian carvings surrounding the Bethesda\nFountain; and Bow Bridge (1:06:38), a cast-iron landmark, is one of the most\nphotographed bridges in the world.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💡 VISITOR TIPS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n▪ Start at The Pond (4:55) for a quiet, scenic entry into the southern end of the park\n▪ Gapstow Bridge (13:02) is the best spot for skyline photos — arrive early to beat the crowds\n▪ Bethesda Terrace (49:31) often has live performers — worth a longer stop\n▪ Bow Bridge (1:06:38) → Conservatory Water (1:23:01) is one of the prettiest stretches of the walk\n▪ Belvedere Castle (1:39:23) has panoramic views of the park and Manhattan skyline\n▪ End at the Imagine Mosaic (3:00:45) in Strawberry Fields, then unwind in Sheep Meadow (3:10:08)\n\n🚷 No portion of this video may be used without prior written consent from Prowalk Tours. If you appear in this video and wish to have your image removed, please contact me.\n\n#CentralPark #NewYorkCityWalkingTour #CentralParkWalkingTour #NYC #WalkingTour\n#NewYorkCity #CentralParkNYC #NYCTravel #BethesdaTerrace #BowBridge","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0AU9_H47w7k/hqdefault.jpg","category":"Nature Trails","channel":"Prowalk Tours","channelTitle":"Prowalk Tours","channelId":"UCNzul4dnciIlDg8BAcn5-cQ","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2023-06-24T13:00:01Z","city":"New York","country":"United States","duration":"PT3H45M29S","active":true,"embedAvailable":true,"thumbnailValid":true,"chapters":[{"title":"Central Park Entrance","startSeconds":219,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":295},{"title":"The Pond","startSeconds":295,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":782},{"title":"Gapstow Bridge","startSeconds":782,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":1071},{"title":"Wollman Rink","startSeconds":1071,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":1477},{"title":"Carousel","startSeconds":1477,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeco