  '7-Hour Walking Tour of Rome, Italy 🇮🇹 | 4K City Walk with Captions',
  'This 12.5 Mile (20 Km) walking tour of Rome, Italy was filmed between May 17th and June 3rd, 2024. It begins at the Spanish Steps and ends at the Orange Garden.

🗺️Map of the Walk - https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/edit?mid=1wJj13at34jAU1c5G4p6r7o8WNvOVRZo&usp=sharing 🗺️

🔻Video Timeline Links🔻
0:00 Intro & Interactive Route Map
*1:10 Climbing the Iconic Spanish Steps*
*27:23 Trevi Fountain – Make a Wish!*
42:29 Hidden Gem: Galleria Sciarra Art Nouveau Courtyard
48:24 Column of Marcus Aurelius
55:11 Temple of Hadrian
1:04:40 Pantheon (Exterior View) – Piazza della Rotonda
1:18:34 Basilica of Saint Mary of Minerva
*1:38:22 Pantheon Interior – Ancient Roman Engineering Marvel*
2:03:20 Piazza Navona - Bernini''s Fountains & Baroque Splendor
2:19:37 Pasquino Statue - Rome''s "Talking" Statue
2:31:53 Ponte Sant''Angelo – Angel Bridge Views
2:35:24 Castel Sant''Angelo – Fortress on the Tiber
2:50:08 Ponte Vittorio Emanuele II – Bridge with a View
2:54:42 Walking Via della Conciliazione toward Vatican City
*2:59:01 St. Peter’s Basilica – Vatican City’s Crown Jewel*
3:26:38 Strolling Via dei Coronari – Rome’s Antique Street
3:41:04 Piazza Navona at a New Angle
3:51:51 Campo de’ Fiori - Markets & Street Life
4:17:29 Basilica of Sant''Andrea della Valle - Baroque Interior
4:30:19 Largo di Torre Argentina - Roman Cat Sanctuary & Temples
4:44:24 Portico of Octavia - Gateway to Jewish Ghetto
4:54:46 Marcellus Theater
*5:02:16 Capitoline Hill*
5:36:39 Monument to Victor Emmanuel II – The “Wedding Cake”
5:41:56 Piazza Foro Traiano – Columns & Statues
5:46:22 Trajan’s Market – World’s Oldest Shopping Mall
5:53:10 Forum of Augustus
*6:06:14 Colosseum*
6:37:19 Arch of Constantine
6:47:01 Circus Maximus – Ancient Chariot Racing Stadium
6:53:30 Rose Garden – Roseto Comunale
7:05:10 Giardino degli Aranci – Orange Garden Sunset Views

