iBAH&si=Zlji0Mfbp3sJlyjs)\n▪ Australia Playlist: (https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLSOO4vYXpMCcuh1sGTbEtCldxhCA6grbV&si=tQ56vSTmsQKUNWjN)\n▪ Complete List of Walks: http://www.prowalks.com/videos\n▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬\n\n===============================================================================\n📢 *SUPPORT & CONNECT* 📢\n🔔 Subscribe for more! (https://www.youtube.com/@ProwalkTours)\n🟥 Become a Member: (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNzul4dnciIlDg8BAcn5-cQ/join)\n🔶 Support me on Patreon - https://www.patreon.com/Prowalks\n🔷 Help with a donation! - https://www.paypal.me/Prowalks\n👕Merchandise - https://teespring.com/stores/prowalk-tours\n===============================================================================\n\n▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬\n🎥 *MY FILMING GEAR (SHOP LINKS BELOW!)* 🎥\n🌍 Amazon Storefront: https://www.amazon.com/shop/prowalktours\n🎥Camera: Sony a7siii: https://amzn.to/4hTUSJj\n📸Camera Lens: https://amzn.to/3UtuZUm\n🎬Gimbal: https://amzn.to/3FsDye5\n🎤Microphone: https://amzn.to/3lYW5CI\n🎧In-Ear Monitors: https://amzn.to/2DBdS1D\n▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬\n\n🚷 No portion of this video may be used without prior written consent from Prowalk Tours. If you appear in this video and wish to have your image removed, please contact me.\n\nThis evening tour takes you on an unforgettable journey through the heart of Rome, offering a unique view of its most iconic landmarks illuminated by the magic of nightfall.\n\nFrom the elegant Spanish Steps to the captivating Trevi Fountain, where millions of travelers toss a coin to ensure their return, the streets of Rome come alive in the soft glow of streetlights. The Pantheon, one of the best-preserved ancient Roman monuments, stands as a testament to Rome’s glorious past. As you stroll through Piazza Navona, filled with fountains and lively street performances, you can feel the heartbeat of the city.\n\nOur walk also takes you into Trastevere, a vibrant district known for its narrow streets and lively restaurants. Here, Roman traditions blend with modern life, making it the perfect place to enjoy a meal and take in the atmosphere. On the third night, we visit Tiber Island, with its ancient bridges connecting the city’s past and present, and conclude the tour at the world-famous Colosseum, bathed in the soft light of the moon, creating an ethereal experience.\n\n#Rome #Italy #eveningtour #history #beautifulplaces #RomanForum #Colosseum","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ew3skC_9FZI/hqdefault.jpg","category":"Walking Tours","channel":"Prowalk Tours","channelTitle":"Prowalk Tours","channelId":"UCNzul4dnciIlDg8BAcn5-cQ","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2024-10-05T13:00:48Z","city":"Rome","country":"Italy","duration":"PT4H38M20S","active":true,"embedAvailable":true,"thumbnailValid":true,"chapters":[{"title":"Spanish Steps","startSeconds":69,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":1142},{"title":"Trevi Fountain","startSeconds":1142,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":1921},{"title":"Galleria Sciarra","startSeconds":1921,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":2378},{"title":"Piazza di Pietra","startSeconds":2378,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":2817},{"title":"Pantheon","startSeconds":2817,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":3671},{"title":"Outdoor Restaurants near Pantheon","startSeconds":3671,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":4343},{"title":"Piazza Navona","startSeconds":4343,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":5149},{"title":"Outdoor Restaurants near Piazza Navona","startSeconds":5149,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":5874},{"title":"Piazza di Pasquino","startSeconds":5874,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":6046},{"title":"Piazza Navon