  'Rainy London | Walking Through the City in the Rain 4K',
  'Join me for a London walk through the streets of Islington on a rainy day. Filmed in 4K with binaural sound and no commentary, this walk captures the reflective atmosphere of North London in the rain — glistening pavements, neighbourhood cafés, and the steady rhythm of the city beneath grey skies.

🎧 Audio Tip: For a truly immersive experience, use headphones to enjoy the binaural sounds recorded on location.
📍 Route: Old Street → Angel → Canonbury → Highbury & Islington → Holloway, North London, UK
🎥 Format: 4K UHD | Binaural Sound | No Commentary

