  'Paris Evening Walk & Bike Ride - 4K 60fps with Captions *NEW*',
  'This walking tour of Paris, France filmed on Saturday July 23rd, 2022 starting at 8:20 PM at Place Saint-Michel.
🗺️Map of the Walk - https://www.google.com/maps/d/edit?mid=17nTBGojUSBQ_vVo5LBLRrM1koOz5AM8&usp=sharing 🗺️

