🏛 Did You Know? The Pantheon, originally a church dedicated to Saint Genevieve, is now the resting place of many famous French figures, including Voltaire and Victor Hugo.

🗼 Fun Fact: The Eiffel Tower sparkles with 20,000 lights for five minutes every hour after sunset, creating one of the most iconic night views in the world.

💬 What’s your favorite place in Paris? Have you visited any of these spots? Let me know in the comments!

🌙 Join me for this unforgettable evening walk through the City of Lights! Don’t forget to like, comment, and subscribe for more immersive walking tours! 🚶‍♂️✨

