  '{"id":"BH9O6_t8FS0","title":"🇯🇵 JAPAN OSAKA NIGHT WALK 🐙 DOTONBORI FOOD STREET [4K HDR - 60 fps]","description":"Get ready for an epic night adventure as we take you on a stroll through the lively streets of Osaka, Japan! On this walk, we''re diving into the heart of Osaka''s entertainment district to soak up the electric atmosphere.\n\nWe''ll be wandering along the canal, surrounded by mesmerizing neon lights reflecting off the water. Keep an eye out for the iconic Glico Running Man and the giant crab billboard, Kanidoraku, which perfectly capture the vibrant spirit of Dotonbori.\n\nBut that''s not all! Get ready to tantalize your taste buds with an array of mouthwatering street food. We''ll be munching on delicious treats like takoyaki, okonomiyaki, and street-side sushi. You won''t want to miss out on these local favourites!\n\nAs we make our way through the labyrinthine streets, you''ll feel the buzz of the crowds and catch street performers showcasing their skills. The energy is contagious, and you''ll get a taste of the unique character that sets Dotonbori apart.\n\nWhether you''re a seasoned Osaka explorer or just dreaming of visiting, this virtual walking tour will transport you straight into the heart of the action. So grab a comfy seat and join us as we unravel the magic of Dotonbori, Osaka, Japan. Don''t forget to hit that subscribe button to stay tuned for more exciting adventures!\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nChapters:\n0:00 Intro\n1:08 Glico Running Man Sign\n4:27 Dotonbori Food Street\n5:33 Octopus Balls\n8:18 Neon Street Signs\n9:45 Shooting Game\n15:05 Old Doutonbori Sign\n20:00 Seafood Arcade\n22:10 Hidden Alleyway\n26:19 Entertainment Distrct\n28:20 Nippombashi bridge\n30:00 Osaka Canal\n32:30 Roller Coaster\n39:18 Party Street\n48:03 Whisky Bar\n52:19 Giant Tanuki Monster\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------