VALUES (
  'RniwGHL7gAw',
  '3 Days in Osaka, Japan | Best Street Food, Hidden Cafés & Local Favorites (4K)',
  'Hello, we''re Yukari and Non 🍵

Join us as we spend 3 days exploring Osaka, Japan''s food capital.

From famous street food and cozy cafés to lively shopping streets, vintage stores, historic landmarks, and local hidden gems, Osaka is full of unforgettable experiences.

In this video, we visit Dotonbori, Osaka Castle, traditional shopping arcades, beautiful shrines, and enjoy delicious local favorites like takoyaki and okonomiyaki.

If you''re planning a trip to Osaka, we hope this guide helps you discover the city''s amazing food, culture, and unique charm.

We hope you enjoy the journey! ✨

🏷️ Timeline
00:00 📍Intro
02:12 📍Neel Nakazakicho
04:57 📍Tenjinbashisuji Shopping Street(天神橋筋商店街)
07:05 📍Cafe Kitahama Retro
09:06 📍Dotonbori(道頓堀)
10:21 📍Konamondokoro Mitsukuni(粉もん処 光圀)
12:51 📍Room Tour
14:11 📍Bread,Espresso & Sakaisuji Club(パンとエスプレッソと)
15:26 📍Osaka Castle(大阪城)
16:33 📍Nanba Yasaka Shrine
17:46 📍Ganso Donaiya Takoyaki Shop
18:43 📍American Village
20:23 📍Komugi no Megami KITTE Osaka
22:20 📍SOMA

📺 Subtitles available (JP / CN / KR / FR / ES / DE)

📹 Camera: Sony a7C

