  '5g7BssZyH_Q',
  'Istanbul, Turkey — Walking Tour 4K 🇹🇷',
  'Istanbul is a city that blends the past and the present, offering a unique experience for the traveler. With its rich history, stunning architecture and vibrant culture. Today''ll explore the best of Istanbul: street food, toy museum, sunset''s boat ride, a huge flea''s market and more! Istanbul Turkey in 4K UHD by Wanna Walk

City Tour Video Walk Istanbul Turkey
Free Walking Tour Turkey Istanbul Türkiye
Top 10 Things to Do in Istanbul Turkey
Things to do - Things to do in Turkey

Welcome to Wanna Walk, your premier guide to immersive travel experiences! In this episode, we embark on an unforgettable exploration of Istanbul, Turkey''s cultural capital. Join me on a mesmerizing journey through its vibrant streets, where we''ll savor every sight, sound, and flavor that this enchanting city has to offer. Today we''ll visit: Bosphorus Boat Tour, Istanbul Airport Free Shop (IST), Hafız Mustafa 1864, Istanbul Toy Museum and Best Flea Market in Istanbul - Ferikoy Antika Pazari.

