VALUES (
  '-ETzyY-oSkk',
  'The Only Walking Tour You Need for One Day in Rome',
  'Only have one day in Rome?

This four-hour walking tour starts and ends at Termini Station and covers Rome''s must-see sites without needing a taxi or bus.

I originally created this Rome itinerary for a cruise passenger with limited time, and it worked so well we turned it into a map. I walk the full route with you, including spots most visitors never find.

Get the map here: https://shop.citywiseglobal.com/products/romewise-map-rome-4-hour-historic-center-walk-digital-download

(The Vatican is not part of this walk.)

—

*WANT A GUIDED TOUR?*

🏛️ Colosseum Tour with Roman Forum & Palatine Hill: https://fas.st/t/tg3ZJPhC
🇮🇹 Rome in a Day Tour: Including Vatican, Colosseum & Historic Center: https://fas.st/t/fWViLA4H
🖼️ The Complete Vatican Tour with Vatican Museums, Sistine Chapel & St. Peter''s Basilica: https://fas.st/t/PXZmCgNe
🚗 Scenic Golf Cart Tour of Rome: https://fas.st/t/ouDXfz4Q
🍽️ Rome: Trastevere & Campo de Fiori Street Food Walking Tour: https://gyg.me/iBZ0NR7O
—

Chapters:

0:00 - Starting at Termini Station
01:27 - Santa Maria degli Angeli and the Baths of Diocletian
03:05- Secret churches: Santa Maria della Vittoria and San Carlo
05:26 - Piazza Barberini
06:07 - The Spanish Steps
08:41 - Piazza San Lorenzo in Lucina / Italian cafe culture
12:20 - Must-see Basilica for Caravaggio fans
13:03 - Piazza Navona and where to eat nearby
16:17 - Piazza Sant''Eustachio (best coffee, gelato, and pizza nearby)
17:06 - The Pantheon
19:06 - Trevi Fountain
20:10 - Piazza Venezia and a hidden garden
21:38 - Campidoglio and the best view in Rome
23:09 - Via dei Fori Imperiali
23:52 - The Colosseum
26:43 - Santa Maria Maggiore

—

*MORE FROM ROMEWISE*
https://youtu.be/oXFQ3sPcsxw?si=yAjY_CuMUXUJrHAG
