  'Rome 2022, Italy Walking Tour (4k Ultra HD 60fps) - With Captions',
  'Please check also our new channel: youtube.com/@WalkingHunterTV We recorded this 4k ultra hd video during our trip to Rome, Italy on May 2022.
Rome is the capital city of Italy and the third most visited city in Europe. An average of 7-10 million tourists visit Rome each year. Its historic centre is listed by UNESCO as a World Heritage Site.
Rome is often referred to as the City of Seven Hills due to its geographic location and also the "Eternal City". Vatican City (the smallest country in the world) is an independent country inside the city boundaries of Rome, the only existing example of a country within a city
Our guided walking tour is about 9.32 miles (15 km) long, starts at Porta del Popolo and covers most attractions and historic sites of Rome.

