  'Immerse yourself in this stunning 4K, 60fps sunset and evening tour of Rome, Italy. 🎧 Best with headphones for an immersive experience (ASMR - Binaural City Sound). ⬇ LINKS to the full videos, chapters, etc. ⬇

Experience the timeless charm of Rome, the Eternal City, where ancient history and modern life blend seamlessly. Once the heart of the Roman Empire, its streets are lined with iconic landmarks like the Colosseum, the Roman Forum, and the Pantheon. As the sun sets, the city transforms—wander through the cobbled alleys of Trastevere, toss a coin into the glowing Trevi Fountain, and marvel at the illuminated beauty of Rome’s most famous sights under the night sky. [Filmed in June 2025]

🗺 Google Maps of this tour 👉 https://hpst.me/WT/Rome/Sunset
i️💁‍♂️ Turn ON the Closed Captions to discover information on attractions, historical facts, and more (Open CC for subtitles). Enjoy!

Watch also:
