  '{"id":"TfvheIZa5yg","title":"Copacabana Beach Evening Walk - Rio de Janeiro, 🇧🇷 - 4K60fps with Captions","description":"Copacabana Beach evening walking tour along the famous 4.5km black-and-white wave-patterned promenade designed by Roberto Burle Marx — an immersive walk along Rio de Janeiro''s most iconic beachfront in Brazil, passing sand sculptures, the boardwalk, and finishing at the lively night market. Filmed in 4K60fps with binaural audio.\n\nThe Copacabana calçadão is one of the most recognizable pavements in the world — 4.5 kilometers of hand-laid black-and-white stone waves, an abstract interpretation of a Portuguese pattern from the early 1900s, redesigned in 1970 by Brazilian landscape architect Roberto Burle Marx (1909–1994). The walk begins at 6:08 PM as golden hour settles over Copacabana, moves along the beach and boardwalk through the evening, and ends at the bustling night market along Avenida Atlântica.\n\nIdeal for virtual travel, treadmill walks, and ambient atmosphere. Best with headphones.\n\n⭐ Don''t miss: Sand sculptures at 12:50, the Burle Marx wave-pattern promenade at 28:34, and the Copacabana night market at 1:24:38.\n\n📅 Filmed on: Saturday, January 20th, 2024 at 6:08 PM\n📍 Location: Copacabana, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil\n🗺️ Map of the Walk: https://www.google.com/maps/d/edit?mid=13HuCbX7i3BM_XDTt_Fm6KhLWUZsiitA&usp=sharing\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⏱️ TOUR TIMELINE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n0:00 Drone Intro and Map\n0:48 Copacabana Beach\n⭐ 12:50 Sand Sculpture & Boardwalk\n15:06 Beach Walk\n⭐ 28:34 Copacabana Promenade (Burle Marx Design)\n36:48 Beach Walk\n45:55 Walk Along the Boardwalk\n55:27 Promenade Return\n1:21:18 Beach Walk\n⭐ 1:24:38 Night Market\n1:37:58 Copacabana Promenade\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🏖️ ABOUT COPACABANA\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nCopacabana is a neighborhood of roughly 350,000 people packed into a narrow strip between the Atlantic and the mountains of Rio de Janeiro. The beach stretches 4.5 kilometers along Avenida Atlântica, and the promenade''s wave-patterned mosaic is considered one of Roberto Burle Marx''s most significant works — he was a student of architect Lucio Costa and contemporary of Oscar Niemeyer, and is credited as a founder of Brazilian landscape modernism. The original Portuguese-style paving was laid in the early 1900s; Burle Marx reimagined it at full scale in 1970. Copacabana hosts the city''s famous New Year''s Eve celebration, Réveillon, which draws millions of people dressed in white to the beach each year.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📽 MORE WALKING TOURS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🇧🇷 Brazil: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLSOO4vYXpMCcefbIXpStQK7fPRJBBiBAH&si=Zlji0Mfbp3sJlyjs\n🌇 Evening Walks: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLSOO4vYXpMCeOzhVqdArVIJ9aiS1Xhw6O\n🌍 Complete List: http://www.prowalks.com/videos\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📢 SUPPORT & CONNECT 📢\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌍 Website: https://www.prowalktours.com\n📧 Email: info@prowalktours.com\n🔔 Subscribe for more! https://www.youtube.com/@ProwalkTours\n🟥 Become a Member: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNzul4dnciIlDg8BAcn5-cQ/join\n🔶 Support me on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/Prowalktours\n🔷 Help with a donation: https://www.paypal.me/Prowalks\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎥 CAMERA & RECORDING GEAR I USE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📱 Beginner / Ultra Portable: DJI Osmo Pocket 3 👉 https://amzn.to/4aelKS2\n🏃 Rugged / Action: GoPro Hero 13 👉 https://amzn.to/4qldBRQ\n🎬 Professional Cinematic: Sony A7S III 👉 https://amzn.to/4qga72E\n🔭 Main Lens: Sony FE PZ 16-35mm F4 G 👉 https://amzn.to/4kiAPX3\n🎥 Gimbal: DJI RS4 Mini 👉 https://amzn.to/4bCxMXM\n🎙️ Microphone: Sony ECM-M1 👉 https://amzn.to/3ZQ75HH\n\n⭐ Essential Accessories\n💾 Memory Cards 👉 https://amzn.to/4tnYeuE\n🔋 Extra Batteries 👉 https://amzn.to/46uvFBC\n🧿 ND Filter 👉 https://amzn.to/46r3RxZ\n🧳 Comfortable Walking Shoes 👉 https://amzn.to/45ORf3G\n🛒 Complete Gear List: https://www.amazon.com/shop/prowalktours\n\n🚷 No portion of this video may be used without prior written consent from Prowalk Tours. If you appear in this video and wish to have your image removed, please contact me at info@prowalktours.com\n\n#Copacabana #CopacabanaBeach #RioDeJaneiro #Brazil #BurleMarx #BeachWalk #BrazilWalkingTour #EveningWalk #WalkingTour #4K","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TfvheIZa5yg/hqdefault.jpg","category":"Beach Walking Tours","channel":"Prowalk Tours","channelTitle":"Prowalk Tours","channelId":"UCNzul4dnciIlDg8BAcn5-cQ","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2024-02-17T14:00:19Z","city":"Rio de Janeiro","country":"Brazil","duration":"PT1H46M38S","active":true,"embedAvailable":true,"thumbnailValid":true,"chapters":[{"title":"Copacabana Beach","startSeconds":48,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":906},{"title":"Beach Walk","startSeconds":906,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":2208},{"title":"Beach Walk","startSeconds":2208,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":2755},{"title":"Walk Along the Boardwalk","startSeconds":2755,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":3327},{"title":"Promenade Return","startSeconds":3327,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":4878},{"title":"Beach Walk","startSeconds":4878,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":5878},{"title":"Copacabana Promenade","startSeconds":5878,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":6398}],"routePoints":[{"name":"Copacabana Beach","type":"chapter-location","verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":0.9,"startSeconds":48,"canonicalName":"Copacabana Beach","sourceVerified":true,"geoVerified":true,"geoSource":"overture-places","overtureId":"172d8b08-8545-405f-9567-dfe218b78add","overtureRe