  'Walking in İzmir, Turkey 🇹🇷 | Güzelyalı, Alsancak & Konak 4K Walking Tour',
  'Walking in İzmir, Turkey 🇹🇷 | Güzelyalı, Alsancak & Konak 4K Walking Tour

Experience a beautiful 4K walking tour through İzmir, Turkey, exploring Güzelyalı, Alsancak and Konak, three of the city’s most popular and lively areas.

This relaxing walking tour takes you through İzmir’s coastal streets, local neighborhoods, busy city center and the famous atmosphere of the Aegean coast. Enjoy authentic street scenes, everyday life, seaside views and the vibrant streets of İzmir in stunning 4K Ultra HD.

Starting around Güzelyalı, we continue toward the heart of İzmir, discovering the atmosphere of Alsancak and Konak along the way. This virtual walking experience is perfect for anyone interested in Turkey travel, İzmir tourism, city walks and relaxing 4K walking videos.

🎧 No commentary – real ambient city sounds.
📍 İzmir, Turkey 🇹🇷
🎥 4K Ultra HD Walking Tour
⏱️ Duration: 1 Hour 18 Minutes

