  'Barcelona, Spain🌙 Evening City Walk | 4K Walking Tour',
  '4K evening walking tour through Barcelona’s modernist heart. Discover architectural masterpieces like Casa Batlló and La Pedrera, along with lesser-known gems that showcase the city’s unique style. The walk takes you through elegant avenues, illuminated facades, and the vibrant atmosphere of the city center at night.

This journey blends Catalan modernism, stunning urban design, and lively evening life, offering a fresh perspective on Barcelona’s architectural treasures.

Perfect for travel lovers, architecture enthusiasts, and anyone seeking a relaxing virtual escape through one of Spain’s most fascinating cities.

📍 Location: Barcelona, Spain
🎬 Filming day: August 26, 2025
📽️ Camera: Osmo Pocket 3 4K 50FPS DLog-M
🎧 Binaural Audio: Roland CS-10EM + Sony PCM A-10

If you enjoy the video, please like and subscribe to support the channel. Thank you! ❤️

