  '{"id":"sRjzYbQ3cFE","title":"Edinburgh, Scotland Walking Tour 4K | Old Town & Calton Hill","description":"Experience the historic city of Edinburgh on this immersive 4K walking tour. Wander through the charming streets of this Scottish capital, taking in the grand architecture and vibrant atmosphere.\n\nThis journey takes us through the heart of the Old Town, where medieval closes and cobblestone streets reveal centuries of history. We continue toward the panoramic views from Calton Hill, then make our way through the bustling platforms of Waverley Station and along the elegant stretch of Princes Street.\n\nThere is no narration and no added music — only natural city sounds and subtle on-screen captions to guide the journey. Footsteps on cobblestones, distant conversations, passing trains, traffic hum, and the rhythm of everyday life in Edinburgh create a truly immersive atmosphere.\n\n📍 Location: Edinburgh, UK\n🎬 Filming day: February 18, 2026, Cloudy ☁️, 6oC, 43oF\n📽️ Camera: Osmo Pocket 3 4K 50FPS DLog-M\n🎧 Binaural Audio: Roland CS-10EM + Sony PCM A-10\n\nIf you enjoy the video, please like and subscribe to support the channel. Thank you! ❤️\n\nTimestamps\n00:00 – Intro\n01:25 – Edinburgh Old Town\n36:52 – Calton Hill\n44:10 – Candlemaker Row & Greyfriars Kirkyard\n1:00:55 – Victoria Street & Grassmarket\n1:09:30 – Princes Gardens & St Cuthbert''s Kirkyard\n1:20:02 – Edinburgh New Town\n\n#edinburgh #scotland #walkingtour #4kwalk #citywalk #relaxingvideo\n\nFiddles McGinty by Kevin MacLeod is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 license. https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\nSource: http://incompetech.com/music/royalty-free/index.html?isrc=USUAN1400051\nArtist: http://incompetech.com/","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sRjzYbQ3cFE/hqdefault.jpg","category":"Walking Tours","channel":"Ambient Explorers","channelTitle":"Ambient Explorers","channelId":"UC1Xv-eIqlHv9agR0DCWaXHw","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2026-02-27T18:03:38Z","city":