  'This is a one-hour walking video filmed in Shinjuku, Tokyo, Japan.

The walk begins at Shinjuku-Nishiguchi Station, passes through the lively streets of Kabukicho, continues toward Yoyogi Station, and heads back toward the Shinjuku Station area.

From neon-lit entertainment streets to calmer local surroundings, this route captures the many faces of Shinjuku.

🎧 No talking – just real city sounds, perfect for studying, relaxing, or working.

🗓️Feb, 2026, 2 p.m.
☀️Weather : Sunny
・Temperature : 14°c/57°f
・ Humidity : 46%

