  'Paris Walking Tour 4K HDR – City Center, Notre-Dame & Châtelet | Summer Walk (29°C)',
  'Experience a sunny 4K HDR walking tour through the heart of Paris, France. Filmed on August 17, 2026, during a warm summer afternoon at 29°C (84°F).

Take a stroll starting from the historic Île de la Cité, passing the iconic Notre-Dame Cathedral, along the Seine River, through Pont Neuf, and into the Cour Napoléon at the Louvre Museum. Enjoy the natural binaural ambient sounds of summer in Paris without voiceover or music interrupts.

