  'jZxYpX97yxs',
  'PARIS WALKING TOUR 4K HDR 🇫🇷 Champs Elysées, Place de la Concorde, Louvre, Rue de Rivoli (1;5 Hour)',
  'Take a relaxing 1.5-hour 4K HDR walking tour through the heart of Paris, France! In this video, we stroll down the iconic Avenue des Champs-Élysées, pass through the historical Place de la Concorde, Jardin des Tuileries, admire the famous Louvre Museum and grand architecture along Rue de Rivoli.

Experience the sights, sounds, and vibrant atmosphere of Paris in stunning high-definition HDR with binaural audio. Perfect for relaxation, study background, travel planning, or a virtual vacation to France.

📍 ROUTE & TIMESTAMPS:
00:00 - Preview
01:00 - Intro / Place Charles de Gaulle
05:56 - Avenue des Champs-Élysées
34:10 - Grand Palais / Petits Palais
41:35 - Bouquet of Tulips by Jeff Koons🌷
47:43 - Place de la Concorde & Luxor Obelisk
57:45 - Jardin des Tuileries
1:06:23 - Louvre Museum (Pyramide du Louvre)
1:12:30 - Rue de Rivoli

⚙️ VIDEO SPECS:
Camera used: Dji Osmo Pocket 4P
• Resolution: 4K Ultra HD (60fps)
• Dynamic Range: HDR (High Dynamic Range)
• Audio: Binaural City Ambience (No Talking)

If you enjoyed this virtual walk through Paris, please LIKE, COMMENT, and SUBSCRIBE to support the channel for more 4K city tours! 🔔

