  'Welcome to Paris, the capital of fashion, food and classic architecture! Filmed in September 2022, we start to see the first falling autumn leaves.
This France walking tour starts in Rue de Passy in the 16th Arrondisement of Paris, then follows its cobblestone streets and Parisian cafes, before crossing and strolling along the Seine River for stunning views of the Eiffel Tower.

Fully shot in 4K HDR, if you enjoyed please like and subscribe!

