VALUES (
  'vwnYjtCTYCM',
  'Paris Walk 4K: Saint-Germain-des-Prés, Saint-Michel & Île de la Cité ⎮ 4K HDR Tour',
  'Experience the historic heart of the Left Bank in this immersive Paris 4K HDR walking tour. We begin in the chic, literary neighborhood of Saint-Germain-des-Prés, weave through the bustling streets of Saint-Michel, and cross the Seine to the iconic Île de la Cité, home to Notre Dame Cathedral.

On this city walk, you’ll see legendary spots like Café de Flore, the historic Latin Quarter, the famous Shakespeare and Company bookstore, and the stunning architecture of the Notre Dame Cathedral. Perfect for travel planning or a relaxing virtual escape.

