  'NEW YORK CITY Walking Tour | NYC Immersive Video with Captions [4K/60fps]',
  'Indulge in this curated 4K, 60fps walking tour of New York City, a vibrant metropolis known for its iconic skyline, diverse culture, and bustling energy. 🎧 Best with headphones for an immersive experience (ASMR - Binaural City Sound). ⬇ LINKS to the full videos, chapters, etc. ⬇ New York City, often called "The Big Apple," is a global hub of culture, finance, and entertainment. Founded as New Amsterdam by the Dutch in 1624, it was later ceded to the British in 1664 and renamed New York. Over the centuries, the city grew into a melting pot of cultures, driven by waves of immigration, particularly in the 19th and early 20th centuries. Today, NYC is celebrated for its iconic landmarks like the Statue of Liberty, Times Square, and Central Park, its vibrant arts scene, and its status as a symbol of opportunity and diversity. [Filmed in August 2024]

🗺 Google Maps of this tour 👉 https://hpst.me/WT/NewYorkCity
i️💁‍♂️ Turn ON the Closed Captions to discover information on attractions, historical facts, and more (Open CC for subtitles). Enjoy!

Watch also:
