VALUES (
  'JXM34j5O6WM',
  'NAIA Terminal 3 Walking Tour: Latest Updates, New Dining and Shops 2026 [4K]',
  'Take a complete walkthrough of Ninoy Aquino International Airport (NAIA) Terminal 3 to see the latest progress on the airport’s major multi-billion rehabilitation under New NAIA Infra Corp (NNIC).

In this silent 4K walking tour, we explore the latest changes across all major levels of the terminal — from curbside drop-off construction outside to the revamped Departures Hall, upgraded Arrivals area, and the expanding wave of new food halls, restaurants, and retail shops.

Whether you''re flying out soon, picking up arriving passengers, or tracking the ongoing modernization of Manila''s main gateway, this unfiltered walk gives you an up-to-date look at NAIA Terminal 3 in 2026.

📍 Location: NAIA Terminal 3, Pasay City, Metro Manila, Philippines
✈️ Key Highlights: Curbside construction, check-in halls, new retail & dining concepts, arrival flow, and facility upgrades.

Timestamps:
0:00 Departures Area 4th Level
4:56 Food Hall 4th Level
7:06 Runway Manila
8:20 Departures Area
12:37 OFW Immigration and Lounge
13:40 Government Services
14:56 Mezza Food Hall
22:27 Tambayan Food Hall
28:36 Arrivals Hall

