Singapore Holiday Sightseeing – Changi Airport Walking Tour. Explore Singapore’s iconic airport as we begin at Terminal 3, ride the Skytrain to Terminal 1, walk through Jewel, and continue to Terminal 2. Discover every floor of Jewel and admire the spectacular Rain Vortex waterfall from multiple angles. A perfect travel experience for tourists enjoying a holiday in Singapore.

