  'Check out the attractions you can do in JEWEL CHANGI AIRPORT! This video includes the full walking tour of Jewel Changi Airport and Terminal 1.

Jewel Changi Airport Attraction Rates:

There are individual or bundle deals available. Here are example of Bundle Deals 1 and 4.

Bundle Deal 1 includes:
1. Canopy Park (Incl. Discovery Slides#, Foggy Bowls, Petal Garden, Topiary Walk)
2. Mastercard® Canopy Bridge
3. Hedge Maze
4. Mirror Maze
5. Walking Net

SGD 39 / USD 30.35 / PHP 1,730

Bundle Deal 4 includes:

1. Changi Experience Studio+
2. Canopy Park (Incl. Discovery Slides#, Foggy Bowls, Petal Garden, Topiary Walk)
3. Mastercard® Canopy Bridge
4. Hedge Maze
5. Mirror Maze
6. Walking Net
7. Bouncing Net

SGD 71 / USD 55.20 / PHP 3,150

For more details, please visit https://www.jewelchangiairport.com/
___

No talk, just walk.

