VALUES (
  'XIIo8yJS-7o',
  'Dubai International Airport Terminal 1 Walking Tour 4K',
  'Walking Tour at Dubai International Airport Terminal 1.

Dubai international airport terminal 1 departure areas include check-in counters, ticket sales counters, oversized baggage check-in, lounges, special handling services lounges, and self-service kiosks. Moreover, it also handles cashier desks, retail areas, a food court, immigration counters, and free Wi-Fi.

Terminal 1 handles all international flights except those operated by Emirates and Qantas.

Passengers may treat themselves to some shopping and dining at Dubai Airport Terminal 1. The terminal’s food court located at Concourse D offers a variety of international dining options the likes of Japanese, Arabic, Mexican, and more.

