  'Scotland 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿 One Hour In Edinburgh: Walking The Royal Mile & Old Town | 4K',
  'I’ve always heard that Edinburgh is one of the most medieval cities in the world, so I decided to see it for myself. I spent the day walking through the Old Town, starting from the Royal Mile all the way up to the Castle. The atmosphere here is incredible—it really feels like stepping back in time.

In this video, I’ll show you my favorite spots. We''ll walk down Victoria Street (yes, it really does look like something out of Harry Potter!) and explore the quiet, hidden corners around Greyfriars that most tourists miss. No fast cuts, just a natural 4K walk through the historic heart of Scotland..

If you’re planning a trip to Scotland or just love old architecture, I hope this walk helps you feel the vibe of Edinburgh. Put on your headphones and let’s explore!

