  'Explore Bern, Switzerland! 🇨🇭 Join this relaxing 1-hour 20-minute 4K walking tour through the historic Old Town, an officially recognized UNESCO World Heritage Site and the capital of Switzerland.

⏰ TIMESTAMPS (Chapters):

00:00 - Bern, Switzerland 4K Walking Tour Intro
12:15 - Historic Medieval Streets & UNESCO Old Town
25:40 - Walking Through the Famous Covered Arcades
38:10 - Beautiful Fountains & Traditional Architecture
51:30 - Exploring Local Shops, Cafés & Capital City Life
1:04:15 - Scenic Bridges & Panoramic River Views
1:15:50 - Peaceful Evening Ambiance (No Talking)

This Bern walking tour takes you through medieval cobblestone streets, charming historic arcades, and beautiful architecture. Enjoy a peaceful city walk with natural ambient sounds — no talking, just the real atmosphere of this magical destination. Perfect for deep relaxation, virtual travel exploration, or background for treadmill walking workouts.

✨ In this walking tour:
- Bern Old Town in 4K HDR 60fps (UNESCO World Heritage)
- Historic medieval streets and charming stone arcades
- Traditional Swiss architecture in the heart of the capital
- Local shops, cozy alleys, and everyday city life
- Relaxing urban atmosphere with pure natural ambient sounds

📍 Location: Bern, Switzerland (Capital City)
🎥 Quality: 4K Ultra HD / 60fps
🎧 Style: Natural Ambient Sounds / No Talking / Slow TV

🎬 DISCOVER MORE SWITZERLAND WALKS:
https://www.youtube.com/@CityWalkerJournal/playlists

If you enjoy long relaxing walking tours, historic cities, and virtual travel, please like, comment, and 🔔subscribe @CityWalkerJournal to support the channel!

