  '{"id":"BaingE6BZ10","title":"A Rainforest Walk to Black Hole Falls - No Talk, No Music, Just Nature. - 4K Virtual Hike","description":"A virtual Rainforest walk & hike on the North Fork Siouxon Trail to Black Hole Falls, with no talk, no music, no close-up shots of my ugly mug... just nature & relaxation. The full journey in real-time, 4K video.\n\nNestled in the South Cascades of Washington - not far from the Portland metro area, but a world away - the pristine rainforest and crystalline water of North Siouxon Creek hides in a rugged canyon, one of the few remaining drainages in the area not scarred by roads and clearcuts. Unlike more popular (but also gorgeous) Siouxon Creek, its cousin to the north is quieter and more of a local secret, partly due to the distances involved & at times sketchy road access and trail.\n\nAside from the lush Pacific Northwest flora, this trail also crosses numerous tumbling side creeks and a few chances to visit North Siouxon Creek itself before climbing to stunning Black Hole Falls. On the way you may spot woodland flowers & glimpses of wildlife, with only the sound of birdsong, wind-rustled trees, and lots of rushing water to keep you company. Enjoy!\n\nHighlights:\n00:00 - Intro\n00:36 - Hike Start\n08:00 - First Creek, Birdsong\n13:50 - Big Trees, First Bridge, & Spot the Snake\n21:25 - Small Falls + Tiny Bridge\n28:50 - Log Crossing\n38:40 - Tiny Bridge #2, More Big Trees\n48:35 - A Broken Bridge, Lovely Rainforest\n58:30 - First View Down North Siouxon Creek\n1:01:23 - Creekside Interlude\n1:07:55 - (Fun!) Tree Bridge\n1:21:30 - Heart of the Rainforest\n1:27:25 - Cliffs & Creek Views\n1:33:18 - Small Falls, Trilliums, More Cliffs\n1:40:17 - Medium Falls, More Rainforest\n1:49:30 - Fallen Giants\n1:52:54 - High Above The Creek + Another Wet Crossing\n2:00:40 - Shadowy Woods\n2:06:30 - Sidetrip to Slide Falls\n2:12:30 - (Sketchy!) Tree Bridge\n2:26:35 - Steep Woods, Another Side Creek\n2:42:38 - The Old Bridge\n2:46:55 - Another Sketchy Crossing\n2:55:15 - Old Bridge #2, Rolling Woodlands\n3:00:32 - Last Side Creek, Even More Big Trees\n3:03:33 - A Junction & The Final Approach\n3:09:02 - Black Hole Falls!!\n3:16:39 - Outro & Ratings\n\nTrip Stats:\n* Distance: 9.8 mi / 15.7 km (roundtrip)\n* Elevation Gain: 2400 ft / 731.5 m\n* Trailhead GPS: 45.9791, -122.2550\n\nFilmed May 2022. I''m still ironing out the camera setup, as well as the format/structure for future videos. Please feel free to comment on the good, the bad, or the ugly; this is an on-going learning experience. My hope is for each video to improve on the last.","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BaingE6BZ10/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Nature Trails","channel":"ExciteHike","channelTitle":"ExciteHike","channelId":"UCuqBQaddluSTw9EdEVwfB2A","badge":"RAIN 4K","publishedAt":"2023-01-05T08:00:08Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":25,"evidence":[{"title":"Hike Start","startSeconds":36},{"title":"First Creek, Birdsong","startSeconds":480},{"title":"Big Trees, First Bridge, & Spot the Snake","startSeconds":830},{"title":"Small Falls + Tiny Bridge","startSeconds":1285},{"title":"Log Crossing","startSeconds":1730},{"title":"A Broken Bridge, Lovely Rainforest","startSeconds":2915},{"title":"First View Down North Siouxon Creek","startSeconds":3510},{"title":"Creekside Interlude","startSeconds":3683},{"title":"(Fun!) Tree Bridge","startSeconds":4075},{"title":"Heart of the Rainforest","startSeconds":4890},{"title":"Cliffs & Creek Views","startSeconds":5245},{"title":"Small Falls, Trilliums, More Cliffs","startSeconds":5598},{"title":"Medium Falls, More Rainforest","startSeconds":6017},{"title":"Fallen Giants","startSeconds":6570},{"title":"High Above The Creek + Another Wet Crossing","startSeconds":6774},{"title":"Shadowy Woods","startSeconds":7240},{"title":"Sidetrip to Slide Falls","startSeconds":7590},{"title":"(Sketchy!) Tree Bridge","startSeconds":7950},{"title":"Steep Woods, Another Side Creek","startSeconds":8795},{"title":"The Old Bridge","startSeconds":9758},{"title":"Another Sketchy Crossing","startSeconds":10015},{"title":"Last Side Creek, Even More Big Trees","startSeconds":10832},{"title":"A Junction & The Final Approach","startSeconds":11013},{"title":"Black Hole Falls!!","startSeconds":11342},{"title":"Outro & Ratings","startSeconds":11799}]},"duration":"PT3H17M14S","active":true,"embedAvailable":true,"thumbnailValid":true,"chapters":[{"title":"Hike Start","startSeconds":36,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":480},{"title":"First Creek, Birdsong","startSeconds":480,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":830},{"title":"Big Trees, First Bridge, & Spot the Snake","startSeconds":830,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":1285},{"title":"Small Falls + Tiny Bridge","startSeconds":1285,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":1730},{"title":"Log Crossing","startSeconds":1730,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":2320},{"title":"Tiny Bridge #2, More Big Trees","startSeconds":2320,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":2915},{"title":"A Broken Bridge, Lovely Rainforest","startSeconds":2915,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":3510},{"title":"First View Down North Siouxon Creek","startSeconds":3510,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":3683},{"title":"Creekside Interlude","startSeconds":3683,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":4075},{"title":"(Fun!) Tree Bridge","startSeconds":4075,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":4890},{"title":"Heart of the Rainforest","startSeconds":4890,"verified":true,"source":"youtube-description","confidence":1,"endSeconds":5245},{"title":"Cliffs & Creek Views","start