  '{"id":"_s7jU75IoTk","title":"Tokyo, Japan 4K HDR Walking Tour 🇯🇵 Day & Night Street Views in 60fps","description":"Discover the heart of Tokyo in this immersive 4K walking tour through one of the world’s most dynamic cities. From the neon-lit streets of Shinjuku to the iconic energy of Shibuya, this walk takes you through bustling districts, hidden alleyways, and some of Tokyo’s most recognizable landmarks. Along the way, you’ll experience the contrast that defines the city, vibrant entertainment areas, quiet side streets, and unique cultural moments around every corner, especially its famous nightlife.\n\nFrom the neon-lit streets of Shinjuku to the iconic energy of Shibuya, this walk takes you through bustling districts, hidden alleyways, and some of Tokyo’s most recognizable landmarks. Along the way, you’ll experience the contrast that defines the city, vibrant entertainment areas, quiet side streets, and unique cultural moments around every corner.\n\nExplore highlights like the famous Shinjuku Cat Billboard, the electric streets of Kabukicho, the narrow bar alleys of Golden Gai, and the world-renowned Shibuya Scramble Crossing. The journey continues through lively shopping streets, rooftop spaces, historic stations, and Tokyo’s iconic nightlife districts.\n\nChapters:\n0:00 Tokyo 4K Walking Intro Preview\n5:00 Shinjuku Electric Streets\n28:13 Golden Gai Narrow Alley Bars\n42:06 Shibuya Scramble Cross Walk\n1:10:51 Miyashita Youth Night Park\n1:44:36 Shibuya Shopping Streets\n2:05:08 Ginza Train District\n2:50:36 Shimbashi Tokyo Nightlife\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------\nWhether you’re here to relax, explore virtually, or plan your next trip, this walk captures the real atmosphere of Tokyo as it unfolds naturally.\n\nIf you enjoy immersive walking tours, consider subscribing for more 4K walks from cities around the world.\n\n#tokyo #japan #walkingtour #citywalk #4kwalk #streetlife #japantravel","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_s7jU75IoTk/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Walking Tours","channel":"World Wanderings: 4K Walking Tours","channelTitle":"World Wanderings: 4K Walking Tours","channelId":"UCiVH7ncT6ghUKvSpY_e0DNQ","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2026-03-27T12:15:10Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":8,"evidence":[{"title":"Tokyo 4K Walking Intro Preview","startSeconds":0},{"title":"Shinjuku Electric Streets","startSeconds":300},{"title":"Golden Gai Narrow Alley Bars","startSeconds":1693},{"title":"Shibuya Scramble Cross Walk","startSeconds":2526},{"title":"Miyashita Youth Night Park","startSeconds":4251},{"title":"Shibuya Shopping Streets","startSeconds":6276},{"title":"Ginza Train District","startSeconds":7508},{"title":"Shimbashi Tokyo Nightlife","startSeconds":10236}]}}',
