2:11:08 — The Historic Nihonbashi Bridge

2:48:46 — Ginza 1-chome: Gateway to Luxury

2:58:05 — Ginza Chuo-dori: Premier Avenue

3:17:11 — Architectural Landmark: Ginza Lion

3:29:48 — Shimbashi Transit Hub

3:37:36 — Karasumori Shrine: Final Destination
🔔 Subscribe for more Tokyo walking tour videos

👍 Like if this cherry blossom season walking tour interested you

#TokyoWalkingTour #CherryBlossomWalk #SakuraWalk #JapanWalkingTour #TokyoSpring #WalkingTour #JapanTravel',
