VALUES (
  'vEmgtGcHTiA',
  '4K Japan Walk 🇯🇵 Tokyo Shinjuku - Afternoon Streets & Urban Vibes | June 2026',
  '👉 Click Here to Explore More Scenic Walks
https://www.youtube.com/@4kwalkingtravel

Welcome to Shinjuku in the afternoon, one of Tokyo’s most dynamic and energetic districts.
In this video, we walk through the lively streets of Shinjuku, where shopping, entertainment, and everyday city life come together.

This walk takes you through the east and west sides of Shinjuku, as well as iconic areas like Kabukicho and Golden-gai bar street.
Experience the busy sidewalks, striking city scenery, and the changing atmosphere of Tokyo in the daytime.

Shinjuku offers a powerful mix of modern city energy and classic backstreet charm, making it one of the most exciting places to explore on foot.
Enjoy this immersive walk and discover the vibrant side of Tokyo.
Please subscribe for more walking tours across Japan and around the world.
If you enjoyed the video, like and share to support the channel.

Temperature：26.3°C/79.3°F
Location：Tokyo, Japan🇯🇵
Date：Saturday, June 13, 2026
Time：4:30 p.m.

#Japan #4kwalk #tokyo #shinjuku

