  '{"id":"bCwUwTcvT2M","title":"PARIS Walking Tour | France City Walks with Captions [4K/60fps]","description":"Visit Paris, a city of romance, history, and iconic landmarks on this curated 4K, 60fps walking tour 🎧 Best with headphones for an immersive experience (ASMR - Binaural City Sound). ⬇ LINKS to the full videos, chapters, etc. ⬇\n\n🔥📚 PARIS Travel Guide 👉 https://hpst.me/ParisTG\nGet our mobile-friendly Paris travel guide with practical tips, must-see attractions, links to directly book tickets, Google maps, itinerary suggestions and more. Thank you for supporting our channel!\n\nParis, the capital of France, is renowned for its stunning architecture, rich history, and cultural charm. From the iconic Eiffel Tower to the historic Louvre Museum, it blends classical beauty with modern vibrancy. The city is famous for its cafés, high fashion, and culinary delights, making it a top destination for art lovers, foodies, and travelers alike. With its romantic ambiance and timeless appeal, Paris is truly a place where history and innovation coexist.\n\nℹ️💁‍♂️ Turn ON the Closed Captions to discover information on attractions, historical facts, and more (Open CC for subtitles). Enjoy!\n\nWatch also:\n• PARIS Sunset Walking Tour (Paris by Night City Walk) 👉 https://youtu.be/6BPuGeS6O4w?si=DIh5mVMawLqq-Gob\n• MONACO Walking Tour (Monte Carlo City Walk) 👉 https://youtu.be/gCy1x1ncd0E?si=jYw7eB8BLlaGUZFt\n• NICE Walking Tour 👉https://youtu.be/-F-agNdrY2Q?si=qMNrNuFxDlaUcwQA\n• EUROPE Walking Tour Playlist (Rome, London, Barcelona, etc.) 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL-uSE59HVj4Ah5kaHKApFBm_Wh2mZ_KWd\n• ASIA Walking Tour Playlist (Bali, Tokyo, Bangkok, etc.) 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL-uSE59HVj4A2IB8EOMXH6AoGVXoRWVHo\n• USA Walking Tour Playlist (Miami, Los Angeles, Las Vegas, NYC, etc.) 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL-uSE59HVj4BUOcpV1xQ_-zNYCA0_CApB\n\nCHAPTERS\n0:00:00 INTRO | Preview\n\nPART I: MONTMARTRE | Moulin Rouge, Sacré-Cœur B