VALUES (
  'YjYmWzY4Un8',
  'Disneyland Paris - 2025 Walking Tour & Rides | 4K 60FPS',
  'Disneyland Paris is one of Disney Imagineer''s most beautiful parks ever created, from the extreme attention to details to the large-scale animatronics and structures found in it''s rides and Castle! We are so excited to bring you this nearly 2-hour tour of the entirety of Disneyland Paris as we cover the entirety of the Park from Main Street U.S.A. (5:50) to Discoveryland (1:37:40)! We will also check out some of Disneyland Paris'' most unique attractions like Big Thunder Mountain Railroad (1:12:20), Phantom Manor (1:22:45), the highly detailed 20,000 Leagues Under the Sea Attraction Les Mystères du Nautilus (1:40:45), and many more! Disneyland Paris is a well-beloved park by main Locals and Theme Park enthusiasts alike. Hopefully, this video will be able to capture that beauty and bring it to your home!

This Walking Tour and Ride Compilation of Disneyland Paris was filmed in Early October, 2025

