31:37 Walking the High Line
34:59 Moynihan Connector
36:51 Empire State Building from Hudson Yards
39:41 B&H Photo Video
42:02 Penn Station & the New Yorker Hotel
46:23 Macy’s Herald Square
50:43 Sixth Avenue (Avenue of the Americas)
51:37 Macy’s Million Dollar Corner

