  '{"id":"0Dd3BjjNvEA","title":"They’re Not Angry. It’s Just Manhattan Before 9AM | NYC 4K Walk","description":"Manhattan before 9AM is fast walkers, office commuters, yellow taxis and a sidewalk rush that can look tougher than it feels. This NYC 4K walking tour follows Eighth Avenue from the Theater District through the Garment District, Penn Station, Hudson Yards and Macy’s Herald Square.\n\nFilmed on a Tuesday morning, this walk begins where the Theater District meets Hell’s Kitchen. We pass the Port Authority Bus Terminal, the New York Times Building and the historic Garment District before reaching the New Yorker Hotel, Madison Square Garden and Moynihan Train Hall.\n\nFrom there, the route moves through Manhattan West and Hudson Yards—home to the Vessel, Edge and the High Line—then returns past B&H Photo, Penn Station and the Empire State Building before ending at Macy’s in Herald Square.\n\nFifty-three minutes of real Midtown Manhattan before 9AM: business clothes, packed sidewalks, subway-bound commuters and the rhythm of New York getting to work. All in 4K, with no narration—just authentic city sounds.\n\n🗓️ Filmed: Aug 4, 2026 | Tuesday | 8:38 AM  | | ☀️ 78°F (25°C)\n🎧 No narration | Subtitles available in 10 languages\n\n00:00 Walking Eighth Avenue at 8AM (Theater District)\n05:12 Port Authority Bus Terminal\n07:18 The New York Times Building\n08:52 Garment District & West 40th Street\n13:17 The New Yorker Hotel\n14:33 Madison Square Garden & Penn Station\n16:56 Moynihan Train Hall & Farley Building\n19:08 Manhattan West\n25:38 50 Hudson Yards & BlackRock\n28:56 The Vessel & Edge at Hudson Yards\n31:37 Walking the High Line\n34:59 Moynihan Connector\n36:51 Empire State Building from Hudson Yards\n39:41 B&H Photo Video\n42:02 Penn Station & the New Yorker Hotel\n46:23 Macy’s Herald Square\n50:43 Sixth Avenue (Avenue of the Americas)\n51:37 Macy’s Million Dollar Corner\n\n🌆 Love this walk? Let’s stay connected! 🚶‍♂️✨\n\n👍 Like this video to support the channel!\n🔔 Subscribe and hit the bell so you never miss a new NYC walk!\n\n☕ Feeling generous? Buy Me a Coffee: https://buymeacoffee.com/maximiniano\n❤️ Tap the “Thanks” button—the 💲 icon below the video—to leave a Super Thanks and a personal message. It’s a great way to support the channel. Thank you!\n\n#NYCWalkingTour #MorningCommute #4KWalk","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0Dd3BjjNvEA/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Walking Tours","channel":"Maximiniano Nascimento","channelTitle":"Maximiniano Nascimento","channelId":"UCEx3GaAYbl6zaf5LK1SerDw","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T16:42:19Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":18,"evidence":[{"title":"Walking Eighth Avenue at 8AM","startSeconds":0},{"title":"Port Authority Bus Terminal","startSeconds":312},{"title":"The New York Times Building","startSeconds":438},{"title":"Garment District & West 40th Street","startSeconds":532},{"title":"The New Yorker Hotel","startSeconds":797},{"title":"Madison Square Garden & Penn Station","startSeconds":873},{"title":"Moynihan Train Hall & Farley Building","startSeconds":1016},{"title":"Manhattan West","startSeconds":1148},{"title":"50 Hudson Yards & BlackRock","startSeconds":1538},{"title":"The Vessel & Edge at Hudson Yards","startSeconds":1736},{"title":"Walking the High Line","startSeconds":1897},{"title":"Moynihan Connector","startSeconds":2099},{"title":"Empire State Building from Hudson Yards","startSeconds":2211},{"title":"B&H Photo Video","startSeconds":2381},{"title":"Penn Station & the New Yorker Hotel","startSeconds":2522},{"title":"Macy’s Herald Square","startSeconds":2783},{"title":"Sixth Avenue","startSeconds":3043},{"title":"Macy’s Million Dollar Corner","startSeconds":3097}]}}',
