  'South Africa Arrival & Departure | O.R. Tambo International Airport (4K Walk)',
  'Experience the full passenger journey through O.R. Tambo International Airport in Johannesburg, South Africa 🇿🇦.

As Africa''s busiest and one of its most important aviation hubs, O.R. Tambo International Airport connects travelers across Africa and the world.

In this immersive 4K walking tour, we explore both the arrival and departure experience, including the Gautrain Station, check-in areas, immigration, departure hall, and boarding process.

🎥 What you''ll see in this video:

• Arrival area
• Immigration and baggage claim
• Arrivals hall
• Gautrain Station
• Check-in area
• Departure immigration
• Departure hall
• Boarding process
• Real airport atmosphere and ambient sounds

Whether you''re planning a trip to South Africa, connecting through Johannesburg, or simply enjoy airport tours, this video offers a realistic look inside one of Africa''s largest airports.

⏱️ Timestamps

ARRIVAL
