VALUES (
  'Chua90zUlFc',
  'Phoenix Sky Harbor (PHX) - Airport Walking Tour',
  'Join us on this comprehensive 4K walking tour of Phoenix Sky Harbor International Airport (PHX) Terminal 4 – the main hub for American Airlines, Southwest, and many others!

We begin at Gate 3 (central area) and take you on an extended airside exploration through the sprawling concourses, covering key gate clusters: from the B gates hallway to Gates B115-B28, along to C11-C19, through C1-C9, over to the D gates including D1-D8 and D11-D18 (with its food court area), then looping back toward the C gates before concluding at Zinc Brasserie near Gate C11 – widely regarded as the best restaurant in PHX Airport for its French-inspired cuisine, cozy vibe, and prime location.
Ideal for passengers with long layovers, those planning routes in Terminal 4''s long corridors and moving walkways, or anyone wanting to preview the airport''s shops, dining, and modern atmosphere.

Filmed in stunning 4K HDR with ambient audio for a relaxing experience – headphones recommended for the sounds, announcements, and footsteps!

🛫 Focus: Terminal 4 airside gates tour (B, C, D concourses)
✈️ All gates in PHX''s largest terminal, accessible post-security
📅 Filmed in October 2025
No commentary – pure ambient airport atmosphere!

Timestamps:
