VALUES (
  'vjmq4dWUDAI',
  'Godzilla Inside Tokyo’s Airport | A Year-End Walk Through Haneda (2025) [4K/HDR/Binaural]',
  'In this video, we visit Haneda Airport Terminal 3, Tokyo’s international gateway for travelers arriving from around the world. If you’re planning a trip to Japan, this terminal may be your first stop. We begin on the third floor, where you’ll see one of the airport’s newest attractions: the impressive Godzilla monument. Then, we head down to the second floor to explore Haneda Airport Garden, a spacious shopping and dining complex conveniently connected to the terminal. Join the walk and get a feel for what awaits you at Haneda Airport.

Location: https://maps.app.goo.gl/koZcECHVewGXqRqTA
Date & Time: 2025/12/29 11:30 08°C/46°F

*************************************************
Chapters
0:00 Opening Title
0:46 Terminal 3 Departure Lobby
2:35 Godzilla up there!
3:32 Godzilla Head
6:04 Restaurants
10:43 Bridge
14:10 Airlines & Airplanes
16:10 Observation Deck
23:01 View of Departure Lobby and Godzilla
35:05 Going down to 2nd Floor
35:56 Haneda Airport Garden
36:50 Would you like these underwears?
45:43 Totoro!
46:57 Going down to 1st Floor
*************************************************

Visit my second 3D channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCx8NxllxgG6Yco6kRgs463Q

X (Twitter): https://twitter.com/VSV_Japan

Recording Devices
Video:
・DJI Osmo Pocket 3
Audio:
・Roland Binaural Microphones CS-10EM
・Tascam DR-07MKII',
