VALUES (
  '_UQR04D0pMI',
  'Changi Airport, Singapore | 4K Walking Tour',
  'We hope you enjoy Christmas in Changi Airport, Singapore, in this World''s Best Airport Walking Tour showing Jewel Waterfall.
''The Jewel'', the world''s tallest indoor waterfall in Changi Airport, Singapore. It forms the centre piece of a vast $1.3 billion mall, with a 130 room Hotel and an 11 Screen IMAX movie theatre.

Arguably the World''s best airport, our walking tour of the Changi Airport Jewel will take you from the Canopy Bridge, Changi Airport Skytrain and Sky Nets near the roof, to the terraced Shiseido Forest Valley on the ground floor, and a view of the underside of the HSBC Rain Vortex below ground.

00:00 Intro
00:29 View of the HSBC Rain Vortex and Changi Airport Skytrain from upper galleries
03:34 Canopy Bridge
06:07 Escalator to Retail Outlets
06:48 View of Children on the Sky Nets Above
08:45 Mid level View of Rain Vortex
13:53 Entering Shiseido Forest Valley
15:00 Close Up View of the HSBC Rain Vortex
18:00 The Rain Vortex from Underneath


