 your purchases at no cost to you.\n\n#singapore4k #changiairport #changijewel #slowtv #citywalks #videowalks #4kwalkingtour walkingtour #livingwalks #4kwalk","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_UQR04D0pMI/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Airport Walks","channel":"Living Walks","channelTitle":"Living Walks","channelId":"UC3iId8RgPvwX7niHr37YjKg","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2020-11-06T08:16:03Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":8,"evidence":[{"title":"View of the HSBC Rain Vortex and Changi Airport Skytrain from upper galleries","startSeconds":29},{"title":"Canopy Bridge","startSeconds":214},{"title":"Escalator to Retail Outlets","startSeconds":367},{"title":"View of Children on the Sky Nets Above","startSeconds":408},{"title":"Mid level View of Rain Vortex","startSeconds":525},{"title":"Entering Shiseido Forest Valley","startSeconds":833},{"title":"Close Up View of the HSBC Rain Vortex","startSeconds":900},{"title":"The Rain Vortex from Underneath","startSeconds":1080}]}}',
