VALUES (
  'Jjhf5546exo',
  'Changi Airport Singapore Walking Tour 2021 [4K] | Terminals 1 & 3 + Skytrain Ride',
  'In this video, we take an evening walk through the quiet terminals of Changi Airport in 2021 and a short ride on the Skytrain from Terminal 3 to 1. Voted World''s Best Airport for 8 years in a row, Changi Airport is a significant transit hub for both passenger and cargo traffic in South East Asia. Like most other airports, Changi Airport experienced a vast drop in passenger numbers due to the shutdown in air travel caused by COVID-19. Join me as we experience a very different Changi Airport in 2021!

#ChangiAirport #Singapore

