04:52 Terminal 3 Departures
16:40 On-Call Skytrain
21:30 Terminal 1 Departures
31:15 Terminal 1 Airside

Filmed on 13 Jan 2021 at 5pm.

Subscribe for more videos of Singapore in 2021!',
