  '{"id":"Jjhf5546exo","title":"Changi Airport Singapore Walking Tour 2021 [4K] | Terminals 1 & 3 + Skytrain Ride","description":"In this video, we take an evening walk through the quiet terminals of Changi Airport in 2021 and a short ride on the Skytrain from Terminal 3 to 1. Voted World''s Best Airport for 8 years in a row, Changi Airport is a significant transit hub for both passenger and cargo traffic in South East Asia. Like most other airports, Changi Airport experienced a vast drop in passenger numbers due to the shutdown in air travel caused by COVID-19. Join me as we experience a very different Changi Airport in 2021!\n\n#ChangiAirport #Singapore\n\nTimestamps:\n00:00 Terminal 3 Airside\n04:52 Terminal 3 Departures\n16:40 On-Call Skytrain\n21:30 Terminal 1 Departures\n31:15 Terminal 1 Airside\n\nFilmed on 13 Jan 2021 at 5pm.\n\nSubscribe for more videos of Singapore in 2021!","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Jjhf5546exo/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Airport Walks","channel":"SingaPOV","channelTitle":"SingaPOV","channelId":"UCIcYuXjLicuGCVHbsGLqBcw","badge":"RAIN 4K","publishedAt":"2021-03-30T05:09:21Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":5,"evidence":[{"title":"Terminal 3 Airside","startSeconds":0},{"title":"Terminal 3 Departures","startSeconds":292},{"title":"On-Call Skytrain","startSeconds":1000},{"title":"Terminal 1 Departures","startSeconds":1290},{"title":"Terminal 1 Airside","startSeconds":1875}]}}',
