VALUES (
  'EzxmcStxL88',
  'Heathrow Terminal 5 Walkthrough | Arrivals & Departures & Airlines (4K Airport Tour)',
  'Enjoy the video? You can support the channel here ☕👉 https://ko-fi.com/castlekingdom

If you''re interested in London transport journeys, I also document Tube and train rides on TwinRover
https://www.youtube.com/@Twin-Rover-Bus-Train/videos

🕒 Timestamps
00:00 – Terminal 5 Exterior & Entrance
01:50 – Entrance for  Departures/Arrivals
02:35 – Meeting Point
03:30 – Arrivals Area
10:40 – Lifts To Departures
10:30 – Escalators To Departures
11:30 – Airline Lounges
14:28 – Arrivals level
18:35 – Check In Area
23:30 – Exit to taxi/pick-up zone & terminal overview

Take a detailed 4K walking tour of Heathrow Terminal 5, one of Europe’s busiest airline hubs. This walkthrough shows you every step of the passenger path — from the drop-off forecourt through check-in, security, duty-free shopping, departure gates, arrivals and onward transport links. It’s great for travellers wanting a virtual preview, orienting themselves before a trip, or anyone into airport ambience and travel footage.

✈️ Airlines operating from Heathrow Terminal 5:
Terminal 5 is the primary hub for British Airways, with most of its domestic, European and long-haul flights running from here. Iberia also operates from Terminal 5 under the same airline group. Codeshare and alliance partners sometimes use the terminal for seamless connections — but British Airways remains the dominant carrier.
heathrow-airport-guide.co.uk

📍 What you’ll see in this walk:

Terminal 5 check-in zones & British Airways / Iberia counters

Security screening & main departure lounges

Duty-free, cafés and shops

Gate areas and airport signage

Arrivals halls, passport control and baggage reclaim

Transport connections (Heathrow Express, Piccadilly Line, buses, taxis)

📌 Hashtags
#Heathrow #HeathrowT5 #Terminal5 #HeathrowAirport #AirportWalk #WalkingTour #4KWalk #BritishAirways #Iberia #TravelGuide #airporttour

If you''re interested in London transport journeys, I also document Tube and train rides on TwinRover
https://www.youtube.com/@Twin-Rover-Bus-Train/videos',
