tishAirways #Iberia #TravelGuide #airporttour\n\nIf you''re interested in London transport journeys, I also document Tube and train rides on TwinRover\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@Twin-Rover-Bus-Train/videos","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EzxmcStxL88/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Airport Walks","channel":"Town & Country","channelTitle":"Town & Country","channelId":"UCChsouhs8S7LMvLBUyinfyA","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2025-12-15T15:00:27Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":10,"evidence":[{"title":"– Terminal 5 Exterior & Entrance","startSeconds":0},{"title":"– Entrance for Departures/Arrivals","startSeconds":110},{"title":"– Meeting Point","startSeconds":155},{"title":"– Arrivals Area","startSeconds":210},{"title":"– Lifts To Departures","startSeconds":640},{"title":"– Escalators To Departures","startSeconds":630},{"title":"– Airline Lounges","startSeconds":690},{"title":"– Arrivals level","startSeconds":868},{"title":"– Check In Area","startSeconds":1115},{"title":"– Exit to taxi/pick-up zone & terminal overview","startSeconds":1410}]}}',
