  'Waikiki Beach, HAWAII Walking Tour | Honolulu BEACH WALK with Captions [4K/60fps]',
  'Immerse yourself in this stunning 4K, 60fps walking tour of Waikiki Beach, Honolulu, Hawaii 🎧 Best with headphones for an immersive experience (ASMR - Binaural City Sound). ⬇ LINKS to the full videos, chapters, etc. ⬇ Waikiki, located in the heart of Honolulu, is a vibrant, world-renowned destination known for its golden beaches, crystal-clear waters, and lively atmosphere. Offering a perfect blend of relaxation and adventure, visitors can enjoy surfing on the iconic waves, explore the bustling shops and restaurants, or immerse themselves in the rich cultural heritage of Oahu [Filmed in December 2024].

🗺 Google Maps of this tour 👉  https://hpst.me/HonoluluWT
ℹ️💁‍♂️ Turn ON the Closed Captions to discover information on attractions, historical facts, and more (Open CC for subtitles). Enjoy!

