  'Walking in İzmir, Turkey 🇹🇷 | Konak Seaside & Karantina 4K Walking Tour',
  'Walking in İzmir, Turkey 🇹🇷 | Konak Seaside & Karantina 4K Walking Tour

Welcome to İzmir, Turkey 🇹🇷! Join me on a relaxing 1 hour 24 minute 4K walking tour along the beautiful Konak seaside and Karantina waterfront, experiencing the authentic atmosphere of İzmir and the Aegean coast.

This İzmir 4K Walking Tour takes you along the waterfront, where you can enjoy beautiful Aegean Sea views, palm-lined promenades, local streets, cafés, parks and everyday city life. Starting around Konak, we continue along the İzmir coastline toward Karantina, capturing the relaxing seaside atmosphere and real life in one of Turkey’s most beautiful coastal cities.

Filmed in 4K Ultra HD with real ambient sounds, this walking tour has no talking, no music and no commentary. Hear the natural sounds of İzmir while exploring the city as if you were actually walking there.

Whether you’re planning a trip to Turkey, searching for things to do in İzmir, or simply enjoy 4K Walking Tours, Virtual Walks, City Walks and relaxing seaside videos, this journey gives you an immersive look at İzmir, Türkiye.

