🇹🇷 EXPLORE İZMİR, TURKEY IN 4K

Discover the beautiful coastline of İzmir, one of Turkey’s most popular cities on the Aegean Sea. From the lively atmosphere of Konak to the peaceful waterfront around Karantina, this walk captures the city’s seaside lifestyle, local atmosphere and beautiful coastal scenery.

This video is perfect for viewers searching for Walking in İzmir Turkey, İzmir Walking Tour, Konak İzmir, Karantina İzmir, İzmir Seaside, Turkey Walking Tour, 4K Walking Tour, İzmir City Walk, Turkey Travel, Seaside Walk, Waterfront Walk, Virtual Walking Tour and Real Ambient Sounds.

