  '[ASMR] Heavy Rain Night Walk in Tokyo: Immersive Street Sounds | Relaxing Natural City Ambience',
  'Hello. Thank you for watching my YouTube channel.
This channel provides 4K/60fps/HDR video and immersive binaural audio of Japan Walk.
This time, I took a walk through a residential area in Adachi City, Tokyo during the heavy rain at night.
Use these rain sounds and city sounds to help you sleep, study, meditate and relax.

