VALUES (
  'LcSoSC0F5uk',
  'London Rain Walk at Night - Mayfair & Marylebone | 4K Ambient Umbrella Rain Sounds',
  'Walking London’s Mayfair and Marylebone on a rainy night, through dark streets with city lights reflecting on the wet ground.

Video themes: London walk, London rain walk, Central London walk, London after dark, London night walk, London Mayfair walk, London Marylebone walk, London city walk, wet city streets, light reflections, England walk, UK capital city.

Sights seen include: Regent Street, Anderson & Sheppard Haberdashery, Cork Street Mews, Burlington Arcade, Bond Street with high-end retailers for fashion & jewellery, ‘Three Figures’ statues in Bourdon Place by Neal French, Hedonism Wines shop, ‘Silence'' mist water feature by Tadao Ando, The Connaught 5-star hotel, 34 Mayfair restaurant, upmarket Mayfair streets, Aston Martin London Mayfair car showroom, Marble Arch with giant illuminated crown to celebrate King Charles III coronation, Marble Arch Statin, DoubleTree by Hilton London - Marble Arch 4-star hotel, St Christopher’s Place, The Coach Makers Arms Pub Marylebone, The Ivy Cafe Marylebone, 108 Brasserie, Cross Keys Close, Marylebone High Street shops, Marylebone Mews, Browning Mews, dark & quite Marylebone streets, The Langham London 5-star hotel, All Souls Langham Place Church, and BBC Broadcasting House.

Recorded - May 2023, weekday late night
Weather Conditions & Temperature - rainy, 13°C/55°F

There’s two WW logos hidden in this video

