VALUES (
  'wVglXsmJ_Ro',
  'Best STREET FOOD in Türkiye!! 🇹🇷 49 Turkish Meals - Istanbul to Gaziantep! [Full Documentary]',
  '👉 SUBSCRIBE for more: https://www.youtube.com/@MarkWiens
👕 T-shirts: https://store.migrationology.com/
🇹🇷 Istanbul Street Food Tour: https://youtu.be/QoG1-v1xagU?si=gbLYq3q9cz8jiMC6

Welcome to Turkey (Türkiye) and for the next 11 Days I’m taking you on an ultimate Turkish street food tour all the way from Istanbul to Gaziantep. We’ll eat some of the most famous, unique, and interesting foods in Turkey!

Our journey begins in Istanbul where we’ll discover some of the most classic Turkish street foods that local people eat. We’ll then travel to Izmir on the Aegean coast for seafood and some unique culinary specialties. From Izmir we’ll continue to Gaziantep, known to be the food capital of Turkey, where we’ll try eggplant kebab, and one of the world’s best baklava. From Gaziantep we’ll go to Adana to try the most famous kebab in Turkey! And finally to wrap up this tour we’ll return to Istanbul for more delicious Turkish food.

This Turkey food documentary not only includes all 49 meals I ate during our trip, but also a lot of behind the scenes and extras scenes from our trip.

Chapters:
00:00 Intro
01:12 Istanbul Street Food Tour
27:01 Istanbul Street Food Tour Part 2
50:12 Top Attractions in Istanbul
01:09:52 Best Doner Kebab in Istanbul
01:22:25 Beyti Kebab in Istanbul
01:29:43 Seafood in Izmir
01:34:57 Izmir Street Food Tour
01:55:52 Day Trip to Ephesus
02:09:32 Gaziantep Street Food Tour
02:33:08 Best Turkish Baklava
02:43:08 Adana Street Food Tour
03:06:41 Best Meat Restaurants in Istanbul
03:17:59 Unique Turkish Street Food

You can watch all the entire series here: https://youtu.be/QoG1-v1xagU?si=T__Hr4dagbTxrnwG

⭐️ Huge thank you to Culinary Backstreets: https://culinarybackstreets.com/ for helping me arrange this Turkish food tour.

★ Follow on Social Media:
Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/markwiensfoodvideos
Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/migrationology/
Tiktok: https://www.tiktok.com/@markwiens

👕 T-shirts: https://store.migrationology.com/
🎥 Camera gear I use: https://amzn.to/3FVdBUd
(some of these are Amazon affiliate links)',
