k.com/markwiensfoodvideos\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/migrationology/\nTiktok: https://www.tiktok.com/@markwiens\n\n👕 T-shirts: https://store.migrationology.com/\n🎥 Camera gear I use: https://amzn.to/3FVdBUd\n(some of these are Amazon affiliate links)","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wVglXsmJ_Ro/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Street Food","channel":"Mark Wiens","channelTitle":"Mark Wiens","channelId":"UCyEd6QBSgat5kkC6svyjudA","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2024-08-17T13:01:03Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":13,"evidence":[{"title":"Istanbul Street Food Tour","startSeconds":72},{"title":"Istanbul Street Food Tour Part 2","startSeconds":1621},{"title":"Top Attractions in Istanbul","startSeconds":3012},{"title":"Best Doner Kebab in Istanbul","startSeconds":4192},{"title":"Beyti Kebab in Istanbul","startSeconds":4945},{"title":"Seafood in Izmir","startSeconds":5383},{"title":"Izmir Street Food Tour","startSeconds":5697},{"title":"Day Trip to Ephesus","startSeconds":6952},{"title":"Gaziantep Street Food Tour","startSeconds":7772},{"title":"Best Turkish Baklava","startSeconds":9188},{"title":"Adana Street Food Tour","startSeconds":9788},{"title":"Best Meat Restaurants in Istanbul","startSeconds":11201},{"title":"Unique Turkish Street Food","startSeconds":11879}]}}',
