Many tourists travel to different cities of this country to eat delicious Turkish food
Istanbul is one of the cities where you can find different restaurants on every street and alley
One of the most famous and popular dishes in Turkey can be introduced as Doner Kebab
Turkish cuisine is very diverse and you can find special food for every taste
Many tourists spend most of their travels eating delicious Turkish food
Street food is very popular in Turkey and as it gets dark you will see street food that sells mostly fish sandwiches and meat and sausage sandwiches.
Turkish restaurants are open until the late hours of the night and all are crowded
