VALUES (
  'axewALA2s_E',
  '🇯🇵 OSAKA, JAPAN 4K WALKING TOUR - Dotonbori & Amerikamura Shopping Distrct | 4K HDR - 60 fps',
  'Osaka Walking Tour in 4K HDR

Experience Amerikamura Osaka in 4K on this immersive 4K walking tour through Japan’s coolest fashion street and the famous Dotonbori cosplay scene.

This Amerikamura Osaka 4K walk starts in the heart of Osaka’s America-themed vintage fashion district, where narrow streets are packed with vintage shops, thrift stores, coffee cafés, pizza restaurants, murals, graffiti art, and bold Japanese street fashion.

This real-time Osaka walking tour in 4K Ultra HD captures Lolita fashion, Harajuku-style outfits, retro Americana clothing, and trend-setting Osaka youth culture.

We finish in Dotonbori’s cosplay scene, filled with anime costumes, creative streetwear, and Japanese pop-culture fashion, making this one of the most immersive Japan 4K walking tours available.
---

Chapters:
0:00 Intro
5:00 Amerikamura Fashion Street
1:06:00 Dotonbori Cosplay Scene

Explore the vibrant heart of Tokyo in this immersive virtual walking tour. Experience the dynamic citylife as we navigate through bustling streets and quiet alleys. From the iconic energy of Shinjuku to the famous Shibuya, this captures the essence of Japan''s capital.

