  'Quiet Suburban Walk in Tokyo from Dusk to Night | Japan 4K HDR',
  'Explore the authentic side of Tokyo with a quiet suburban walk from Aoto Station to Ayase Station. This tour captures the local lifestyle of Katsushika City during the beautiful dusk hours of mid April. Along the way, we visit the serene Aoto Peace Park and discover a unique meat vending machine on a residential street. The walk concludes at the vibrant Ayase Station as night falls. Perfect for those who want to see the real, peaceful streets of Tokyo away from the tourist crowds.

Filmed in 4K HDR with high quality stereo sound.
The Google Maps link below shows the full walking route with chapter timestamps.

Don’t forget to like, comment, and subscribe for more Tokyo walking tours.

