VALUES (
  '8Y5fR60N4us',
  '🇯🇵 [4K] Tokyo Japan Walking Tour - Ameyoko Markets & Ueno Shopping Street | 4K HDR 60fps',
  'Join us on an awesome journey through Tokyo''s bustling streets as we explore the dynamic Ameyoko Markets and Ueno Shopping Street!

Experience the vibrant atmosphere, crazy street food, bug vending machines, American street fashion, unearth hidden treasures, and embrace the fusion of traditional and modern culture in this iconic district of Tokyo.

From delectable street fare to unique keepsakes, the Ameyoko Markets offer an unparalleled shopping escapade. Meanwhile, the Ueno Shopping Street boasts top spots for fashion, electronics, and beyond. Don''t miss this unforgettable Tokyo adventure!

Be sure to like, comment, and subscribe for more thrilling city explorations and travel escapades! 🌍✈️

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Chapters:
0:00 Intro
5:00 Ameyoko Market
1:04:00 Ueno Night Walk

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Intro music produced by Ryan Booth at The JamBooth Recording Studio.
https://thejambooth.wixsite.com/music​
https://facebook.com/JamBoothMusic/

