VALUES (
  'nXjRc2FaTVw',
  '4K Tokyo Japan | Complete Spring Walking Tour Through Cherry Blossoms & Iconic Streets',
  'Experience Tokyo in spring like never before with this 4K walking tour! Wander beneath cherry blossoms, explore the historic Senso-ji Temple, and stroll through the bustling streets as night falls. Immerse yourself in the sights, sounds, and atmosphere of Japan’s capital in stunning HDR 60fps — perfect for relaxing, studying, or virtual travel.

What you’ll see in this walk:
• Blooming cherry blossoms along scenic streets
• Historic Senso-ji Temple and surrounding lanes
• Nighttime streets glowing with neon lights
• Local shops, markets, and traditional architecture

Chapters:
0:00 Preview Highlights
1:58 Walkthrough Shinjuku Gyoen National Gardens
31:08 Shrine Visit in the Spring
38:00 Walking Shinjinku District
47:00 Shinjinku Cat Billboard
52:46 Godzilla Statue
55:12 Popular Red-light District
1:01:13 Famous Alleyways of Golden Gai
1:09:21 Entering Senso-ji Temple Area
1:46:33 Asakusa Shopping District
1:57:16 Sumida River.Cherry Blossom Walk
2:25:03 Night Hangouts at Miyashita Park
2:51:10 Roppongi Hills Mori Tower Gardens

Don’t forget to like, comment, and subscribe for more immersive walking tours from around the world.

