4:57 Chuo-dori Shopping Street
24:58 Louis Vuitton Tokyo Ginza Namikidori
51:39 Maison Hermes
59:48 Tokyu Plaza Omotesando Omokado
1:15:25 Harajuku Street
1:23:17 Takeshita Street

Wako Ginza
Matsuya Ginza
Nihombashi Mitsukoshi Main Store
Isetan Shinjuku

