VALUES (
  'WHFosF8lyic',
  'Hampstead Village London Walking Tour 4K | England''s Most Expensive Village',
  'Welcome to Hampstead Village  the most expensive village in England. This 4K walking tour takes you through its leafy lanes, celebrity-fronted Georgian streets, and hidden courtyards that most tourists never see.Join me on an immersive, no-cut stroll through one of London''s best-kept secrets. From the cobbled lanes of the Old Village to the boutiques of Hampstead High Street, soak in the historic charm, the millionaire townhouses, and the famous faces who''ve called this village home  from Dickens to the Beatles.

📍 What you''ll see on this walk:
Hampstead Village''s historic cobbled lanes & old-world charm
Georgian & Victorian townhouses of London''s wealthiest village
Hampstead High Street''s independent stores & cafés
The leafy streets that lead toward Hampstead Heath
A glimpse of the celebrity hideaways that give this village its mystique
If you love relaxing virtual walking tours of London, hit Subscribe for more 4K strolls through the city''s most beautiful neighbourhoods  and comment below which London village you want me to explore next!

