VALUES (
  'xU33LGt3KSw',
  'Complete London Walking Tour | 12 Hours of Iconic Streets, Parks and Landmarks | 4K',
  'Join us on The Ultimate 12 Hour London Walking Tour as we explore the iconic city of London, England, and uncover its hidden gems. Walking in London is a great way to experience the city''s vibrant energy, and this 12-hour walk will take you through the best of central London. From famous landmarks to quirky neighborhoods, we''ll show you the real London, all in stunning 4K. Whether you have 12 hours in London or a lifetime, this London walking tour is the perfect way to get a taste of the city. So, lace up your walking shoes and get ready to explore one of the world''s greatest cities. This London travel guide is packed with insider tips and off-the-beaten-path destinations, making it the ultimate London walking tour 4K. So, what are you waiting for? Join us on this epic London city tour and discover the magic of London, England!

