Hello everyone !

WELCOME TO PARIS WALKING TOUR,

Join with me to explore one of the most beautiful and historic parts of Paris 🇫🇷

In this walking tour, we begin at the iconic Pont des Arts, stroll through the lively Rue Buci in the Latin Quarter, and pass through the hidden Cour du Commerce Saint-André—before continuing in to the charming streets of Saint-Germain.

