  'Paris Walking Tour 2026_ Montparnasse to Rue de Rennes (4K HDR)',
  'Experience a beautiful spring afternoon walking in Paris on May 2, 2026. This 4K HDR walking tour takes you through the heart of Montparnasse, from the theaters of Rue de la Gaîté to the shopping district of Rue de Rennes.

