  '{"id":"1-8U9_dhcFk","title":"🇹🇷 Turkey Istanbul 4K Walking Tour 2026 | Şile Streets, Lighthouse, Cafes, Marina & Sea Views","description":"''''🇹🇷 Turkey Istanbul 4K Walking Tour 2026 | Şile Streets, Lighthouse, Cafes, Marina & Sea Views''''\n\nHey there! This 4K Istanbul walking tour takes you through Şile, a charming famous coastal town on the Asian side of Istanbul, known for its historic lighthouse, cozy town center, and breathtaking views of the Black Sea. Filmed in real time with no music and no commentary in sunny day of May 2026, this immersive city walk captures busy streets, local markets, cafés, waterfront views, and the energetic daily life that defines Şile.\n\nIn this 4K walking tour, we explore the vibrant Atatürk Meydanı (Ataturk Square) – a lively central square surrounded by shops and markets. Then continue to the bustling Üsküdar Street, lined with traditional Turkish bakeries, ice cream vendors, restaurants, local clothing shops, and the famous Halvacı Ali 1900, where you can taste traditional Turkish halva, The beautiful coastal park and sosyal tesisleri, where locals relax with views of the waves crashing below. Also we explore the iconic Şile Lighthouse (Şile Feneri) – the second oldest and tallest active lighthouse in Turkey, offering panoramic sea views.\n\nFrom local street food flavors to seaside cafés and authentic Turkish street life, this video captures the peaceful yet vibrant energy of Şile — a favorite summer getaway for locals and tourists alike.\n\n📌 Şile, located on the northern coast of Istanbul’s Asian side, blends nature, history, and lifestyle. Just 70 km from central Istanbul, this district offers a slower pace of life, beautiful Black Sea beaches, and Ottoman-era charm.\n\n🎥 Whether you’re planning a trip to Turkey or just want to experience the local culture from your screen, don’t miss this immersive walking tour in UHD 4K 60FPS. If you enjoy Istanbul walking tours, markets, and real street life, please like, comment, an