VALUES (
  'D7DZrDaDLyo',
  'Istanbul Turkey Walking Tour 4K: The Full 2-Hour Experience! (Everything Included)',
  'Join me on a massive 2-hour immersive journey through the heart of Istanbul, Turkey. In this 4K walking tour, we explore everything from the majestic mosques and the historic Topkapi Palace to the vibrant energy of the Grand Bazaar and the scenic shores of the Bosphorus.

Experience the sights and sounds of one of the world''s most beautiful cities as we walk through its most iconic landmarks. Whether you are planning a trip or just want to relax and enjoy the "Turkey ambient" vibes, this is the ultimate Istanbul guide for you.

00:00 - Introduction to Istanbul Walking Tour
05:00 - Walking Toward Arasta Bazaar
10:20 - Exploring Arasta Bazaar
14:38 - Walking Toward the Blue Mosque
15:53 - The Hippodrome of Constantinople
20:22 - Inside the Blue Mosque: Architecture & History
26:15 - Walking from Blue Mosque to Topkapi Palace
26:40 - Topkapi Palace Grounds & Interior Visit
1:51:50 - Walking from Topkapi Palace to Gülhane Park
2:04:09 - Bosphorus Bridge & Ship Views
2:06:41 - Mısır Çarşısı (The Spice Bazaar)
2:14:38 - Eminönü Yeni Cami (The New Mosque)
2:17:08 - Night Walk: Streets After the Bazaar
2:19:43 - Blue Mosque & Hagia Sophia at Evening

📍 Key Locations in this Tour:

Topkapi Palace: Step back in history at the residence of Ottoman Sultans.
Grand Mosque: Witness the architectural beauty and spiritual heart of the city.
Grand Bazaar: Get lost in the colors and flavors of the world''s most famous market.
Bosphorus Bridge & Shore: Watch the ships pass by on the water that connects two continents.
Istanbul Streets: Authentic city life and hidden gems.
If you enjoyed this tour, please LIKE and SUBSCRIBE to SDA Dan Travel for more travel adventures!

Which part of Istanbul was your favorite—the history of Topkapi Palace or the view of the Bosphorus? Let me know in the comments!

