VALUES (
  '1zO8hm9OWvE',
  'Istanbul Turkey 2026 4K Walking Tour 🇹🇷 Ortaköy Kumpir Street, Souvenir Market & Bosphorus Views',
  'Istanbul 4K Ortaköy Bosphorus walking tour exploring local streets, famous Kumpir street food, Ortaköy Mosque, souvenir markets, boutique cafés and a Bosphorus boat cruise past luxury Çırağan Palace.

Welcome to an extraordinary Istanbul Walking Tour through one of the most vibrant historic districts on the Bosphorus. Located right under the iconic Bosphorus Bridge on the European shore, Ortaköy has been a cosmopolitan gathering place since Ottoman times. This immersive Istanbul Travel Guide takes you beyond the usual tourist square into authentic residential backstreets, charming neighborhood bakeries, and local coffee shops along Dereboyu and Eski Bahçe streets.

Experience authentic Turkey Istanbul atmosphere as we wander through artisanal craft markets and the world-famous Kumpir Street, known for delicious Turkish stuffed baked potatoes. Our journey continues along the waterfront to the 19th-century Baroque Ortaköy Mosque (Büyük Mecidiye Camii), followed by a scenic Bosphorus ferry ride past Galatasaray University and the magnificent Çırağan Palace Kempinski. If you are planning Turkey Travel or looking for a relaxing 4K visual experience, this tour captures the perfect blend of local daily life and luxury Bosphorus landmarks.

If you are searching for the best things to do in Ortaköy or looking for top Bosphorus photo spots, this area offers an iconic backdrop of the Bosphorus Bridge and seaside architecture. Beyond the historic sights, it is a prime destination for an authentic Istanbul street food guide, where visitors can enjoy traditional Turkish tea, fresh waffles, and Kumpir along the lively waterfront promenade connecting Beşiktaş to Kuruçeşme.

🔔 Don''t miss our next immersive walking tour exploring Istanbul''s most beautiful neighborhoods, luxury destinations, hidden gems and authentic local life. Subscribe now and turn on notifications so you never miss a new journey.
🔗 https://www.youtube.com/@walkwithme.3

📢 Privacy Notice: This video is filmed in public spaces to document the city''s daily life and architecture. If you appear in this footage and prefer to have your image blurred or removed, please contact me via the comments or channel email, and your request will be processed immediately.

🎥 Video Information 🎥
Format: 4K Ultra HD HDR — Real Binaural Sound
Camera: OSMO Action Pro 5 (4K 60fps) @DJI
Experience: No talking — Immersive city ambience
📍 Location: Ortaköy, Istanbul, Türkiye
📅 Date: 2026

