  'Rome, Italy – From Rome’s Monti District to the Colosseum | Hidden Streets 4K Walking Tour',
  'Rome Walking Tour 4K HDR | Real-Time City Walk

🚶‍♂️ Walk through Rome in real time — no cuts, no commentary.
Just the city as it feels when you walk it.

👋 I’m Luca, born and raised in Rome.
This walk follows streets locals cross every day, not just the ones tourists search for.

🔎 No voice, no interruptions.
If you turn on subtitles, Rome starts speaking — quietly — with stories, details and history most people never notice.

▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

📍 TOUR DETAILS

• Location: Rome, Italy
• Area covered: Esquilino, Monti
• Recorded: Saturday, 21 February 2026 at 9:30 AM
• Weather: 11°C \ 52°F
• Distance: 2,7 KM \ 1,6 MI

▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

🗺️ MAP OF THE WALK

https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/edit?mid=1JGXziVHlQQhM2ynMeMYtqboHgEUZwx8&usp=sharing

▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

🏛️ HIGHLIGHTS

• Basilica of Saint Pudentiana
• Via Urbana
• Piazza della Madonna dei Mont
• Basilica of San Pietro in Vincoli
• Clivio di Venere Felice

▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

💝 SUPPORT THE CHANNEL

🔔 Subscribe so you don’t miss the next walk:
