  '{"id":"2BfHMnDOteA","title":"Venice, Italy Ultimate Walking Tour – Rialto, San Marco & Historic Venice | 4K 60fps","description":"Venice Ultimate walking tour — Part 1 of a 7-hour walk through the historic center of Venice, Italy, starting at the Rialto Bridge and covering the Fish Market, Piazza San Marco, the Bridge of Sighs, Campo Santi Giovanni e Paolo, and countless hidden campos and canals off the tourist path. Filmed in 4K60fps with binaural audio.\n\nVenice was built on 118 small islands in a saltwater lagoon and has been a UNESCO World Heritage site since 1987. This walk begins near the Rialto Bridge — completed in 1591 by Antonio da Ponte — and spends nearly 4 hours through the labyrinthine alleys, hidden campos, and working neighborhoods of San Marco, Castello, and Cannaregio.\n\nIdeal for virtual travel, treadmill walks, and ambient atmosphere. Best with headphones.\n\n⭐ Don''t miss: Rialto Bridge at 4:38, the Fish Market at 33:35, the Scenic Rooftop Terrace at 58:26, Piazza San Marco at 1:31:55, St. Mark''s Campanile view at 1:41:17, the Bridge of Sighs at 2:03:52, the Amazing Book Store (Libreria Acqua Alta) at 2:47:26, and the grocery store inside an old theater at 3:49:12.\n\n📅 Filmed on: Saturday, July 2nd, 2022 at 10:50 AM\n🌞 Weather: 32°C | 90°F\n📍 Location: Venice, Veneto Region, Italy\n🗺️ Map of the Walk: https://www.google.com/maps/d/edit?mid=14X7n1movkk-1Sko5mBbcqGDKb5T46zI&usp=sharing\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⏱️ TOUR TIMELINE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n0:00 Intro and Map\n⭐ 4:38 Rialto Bridge and Canal Walk\n26:58 Venetian Mask Shop\n⭐ 33:35 Fish Market\n44:22 Campo Erberia\n51:56 Rialto Bridge\n⭐ 58:26 Scenic Rooftop Terrace\n1:16:25 San Salvador Church\n⭐ 1:31:55 Piazza San Marco\n⭐ 1:41:17 St. Mark''s Campanile View\n⭐ 2:03:52 Bridge of Sighs\n2:04:33 Waterfront Walk\n2:15:00 Hidden Heart\n2:26:10 Campo San Zaccaria\n2:28:39 Campo Santi Filippo e Giacomo\n2:29:59 Ponte de Canonica\n2:34:36 Calle Larga S. Marco\n2:38: