VALUES (
  'Gy6fDx9L-zk',
  'Rome Night Walking Tour 4K with Captions - Prowalk Tours',
  'The evening walk of Rome, Italy was filmed on Saturday October 10th, 2020 starting at 6:32 pm on the Ponte Sant Angelo.
