VALUES (
  'ft2D3tTHM3M',
  'Rome Italy, The Perfect Time for a Walk | Walks in Rome',
  'Rome Walking Tour 4K HDR | Real-Time City Walk

🚶‍♂️ Walk through Rome in real time — no cuts, no commentary.
Just the city as it feels when you walk it.

👋 I’m Luca, born and raised in Rome.
This walk follows streets locals cross every day, not just the ones tourists search for.

🔎 No voice, no interruptions.
If you turn on subtitles, Rome starts speaking — quietly — with stories, details and history most people never notice.

▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

📍 TOUR DETAILS

• Location: Rome, Italy
• Area covered: Campo Marzio, Colonna,
• Recorded: 7 AM May 2026
• Weather: 16°C \ 61°F
• Distance: 3,3 km \ 2.0 mi

▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

🗺️ MAP OF THE WALK

https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/1/edit?mid=1AIw9LqZ7rAN6_0kiBBoadcmbi5PC-Ac&usp=sharing

▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

🏛️ HIGHLIGHTS

• Via Margutta
• Piazza del Popolo (People''s Square)
• Piazza di Spagna (Spanish Steps Square)
• Porto di Ripetta (Ripetta River Port)
• Church of Saint Jerome of the Croats

▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

💝 SUPPORT THE CHANNEL

🔔 Subscribe so you don’t miss the next walk:
