  '{"id":"KSVkmoJOOTU","title":"Frankfurt Airport Walking Tour | Terminal 1 to Terminal 2 + Secret Plane Spotting Spot ✈️ | 4K HDR","description":"Flying through Frankfurt Airport? Nervous about navigating Terminal 1 or Terminal 2? Whether it''s your first time or you''re looking for tips to make your travel smoother, this 4K HDR virtual walking tour has you covered!\n\nWe’ll guide you step-by-step from the airport train station, through Terminal 1, and most importantly, show you the shortest way to Terminal 2, home to many international airlines. 🚶‍♀️\n‼️Stay tuned until the end! You''ll discover a hidden gem: the Visitors'' Terrace at Terminal 2, a perfect spot to watch planes take off and land. It''s also a relaxing place for passengers waiting to check in, giving you a peaceful break from the hustle and bustle of the airport. This area is a favorite for aviation enthusiasts, locals, and photographers alike!\n\n🕒 Video Chapters:\n00:00 – Preview with Music\n01:39 – Frankfurt Airport Tour Begins (Stepping off the train 🚆)\n10:04 – Exploring Terminal 1\n11:31 – Flight Information Board ✈️\n13:45 – Shopping Area in Terminal 1 🛍️\n17:48 – Transfer to Terminal 2 via SkyLine (Important!) 🚝\n19:27 – SkyLine Station\n20:27 – Riding the SkyLine (Must-See!) 🌉\n26:09 – Welcome to Terminal 2\n30:10 – Flight Crew: Pilots & Cabin Crew Spotted 👨‍✈️👩‍✈️\n32:51 – McDonald''s & Relaxation Area 🍔☕\n35:24 – Secret Plane Spotting Spot (Hidden Gem! 🛫)\n43:19 – Must-See: Runway Timelapse\n\n👉 Don’t forget to:\n✅ Like this video 👍\n✅ Share your Frankfurt Airport experiences in the comments 📝\n✅ Subscribe for more virtual tours! ➤ @OhMyPOV\n\n🔗 Watch next:\n🇳🇱Rotterdam, Netherlands Walking: https://youtu.be/0JcpMqL4R_o\n🇳🇱Exploring the fairytale village Giethoorn: https://youtu.be/5DLVmmLJLwI\n🔥Walking in Frankfurt Central Station➤ https://youtu.be/ivg5u9SNDnc\n🔥MUST SEE! Driving in Frankfurt Skyline➤ https://youtu.be/rTO7sICY3JM\n🔥Walking in one of the most beautiful cities in Germany: https://youtu.be/WCizo9eKZZk\n\n🎥 Best Viewing Experience:\nWatch on a 4K widescreen setup for an immersive virtual tour of Europe’s urban and natural landscapes, with a focus on Germany!\n\n📌 Keywords:\n#FrankfurtAirport #GermanyTravel #PlaneSpotting #AviationLovers #TravelTips #germany4k\n#walkingtour #Frankfurt4K #FrankfurtWalkingTour #TravelGermany\n\n🔒 Legal Guidelines:\nOur videos capture public spaces in various cities, and people may be recorded incidentally. In Germany, filming in public is allowed as long as individuals are not the main focus. If you appear in this video and would like your face blurred, please contact us via email.\nCopyright © 2024. Oh MyPOV Tour Channel. All Rights Reserved.","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KSVkmoJOOTU/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Airport Walks","channel":"Oh MyPOV Tour","channelTitle":"Oh MyPOV Tour","channelId":"UCnuMgzzZv7TdNbyIfrAVU9A","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2024-11-16T17:00:18Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":13,"evidence":[{"title":"– Preview with Music","startSeconds":0},{"title":"– Frankfurt Airport Tour Begins","startSeconds":99},{"title":"– Exploring Terminal 1","startSeconds":604},{"title":"– Flight Information Board ✈️","startSeconds":691},{"title":"– Shopping Area in Terminal 1 🛍️","startSeconds":825},{"title":"– Transfer to Terminal 2 via SkyLine (Important!) 🚝","startSeconds":1068},{"title":"– SkyLine Station","startSeconds":1167},{"title":"– Riding the SkyLine (Must-See!) 🌉","startSeconds":1227},{"title":"– Welcome to Terminal 2","startSeconds":1569},{"title":"– Flight Crew: Pilots & Cabin Crew Spotted 👨‍✈️👩‍✈️","startSeconds":1810},{"title":"– McDonald''s & Relaxation Area 🍔☕","startSeconds":1971},{"title":"– Secret Plane Spotting Spot","startSeconds":2124},{"title":"– Must-See: Runway Timelapse","startSeconds":2599}]}}',
