VALUES (
  'v5m_KXoyM2I',
  'Seattle Tacoma International Airport COMPLETE Tour Concourse A to S | POV Walk of Sea-Tac SEA ✈️ 4K',
  'Experience a complete, immersive 4K POV walking tour of Seattle-Tacoma International Airport (SEA). This walkthrough covers the entire airport layout, from the expansive Concourse A to the newly renovated International Arrivals Facility and the S Gates. Whether you’re navigating a layover, checking out the new dining options, or just enjoy the ambient sounds of travel, this is the ultimate Sea-Tac guide.

In this SEA Airport Walking Tour:

The Main Terminal: A look at check-in, security, and the central atrium.
All Concourses (A, B, C, D, N, & S): First-person perspective of every gate area.
Dining & Art: Spotlighting the unique Pacific Northwest flavors and art installations throughout the terminal.
The Satellite Trains: A quick look at the underground transit system connecting the North and South satellites.
Traveler Tips: Visual cues for baggage claim and ground transportation.

