Experience a full POV walking tour of Seattle-Tacoma International Airport (SEA / SEA-TAC) — filmed in crystal clear 4K. This walkthrough covers every major concourse, including Concourse A, B, C, D North and South Satellite (N and S Gates) and, Central Terminal Atrium  stick till the end for some plane spotting while inside the airport.

Whether you''re planning a trip, just landed at SEA, or love exploring airports around the world, this video takes you through the shops, restaurants, lounges, gates, walkways, escalators, and terminal vibes — all at a calm walking pace.

🎧 No commentary. Just natural airport ambience.

