known for its cleanliness, efficiency, and excellent passenger services. With its impressive size and modern design, it remains one of the most enjoyable airports for travelers passing through South Korea.\n\nIf you enjoy airport walking tours, travel videos, and aviation content, this video gives you a closer look at one of Asia’s most iconic international airports.\n\nVideo Chapters\n\n00:00 Preview\n02:33 Arrival/Transfer Area\n09:33 Transfer Train to Terminal 1\n15:25 e-Arrival Card Kiosk\n15:25 Immigration Area\n16:59 Baggage Claiming Area\n21:38 Arrival Area Exit (Convenience Store/Cafes/Restaurants/Bus Ticket Booth/ATM''s)\n25:44 Bus Ticket Kiosk\n26:21 Bus Stop (going to Seoul)\n27:01 Outside of the Departure Area\n27:40 Check-in Counters N to A\n37:17 Tax Refund Kiosk\n47:52 Access to Boarding Area\n49:19 Boarding Gates 26 - 28\n51:38 Tax Refund (Kiosk & Counter)\n54:36 Access going to Boarding Gates 101-132\n57:35 Shuttle Train going to Boarding Gates 101-132\n01:01:44 Boarding Gates 121 - 132\n01:09:48 Food Court\n01:11:31 Boarding Gates 101 - 114\n01:11:56 Gourmet Bridge (Food Court)\n\n👍 Don’t forget to like, comment, and subscribe for more airport walking tours and travel videos from destinations around the world!\n\n#IncheonAirport #ICNAirport #IncheonInternationalAirport #SeoulAirport #SouthKoreaTravel #AirportWalkingTour #AirportTour #TravelKorea #SeoulTravel #AirportWalkthrough #ICNTerminal1 #KoreaAirport #TravelAsia #AirportArchitecture #4KWalkingTour","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hHsoBzhx8Nw/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Airport Walks","channel":"Stroll with DeshiMike","channelTitle":"Stroll with DeshiMike","channelId":"UClCwaA7e-DK7iwHKusVFNRA","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2026-03-17T05:43:31Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":20,"evidence":[{"title":"Arrival/Transfer Area","startSeconds":153},{"title":"Transfer Train to Terminal 1","startSeconds":573},{"title":"e-Arrival Card Kiosk","startSeconds":