VALUES (
  'EH_daU-Zlyg',
  'Haneda Airport Terminal 3 Walk 2026 Summer: From Edo Streets to Sunset Runway Views! [4K with MAP]',
  'Unlock the ultimate journey through Tokyo''s world-class sky portal, Haneda Airport Terminal 3! Step beyond the standard departures into an incredible blend of futuristic luxury, authentic Edo tradition, and mesmerizing runway vistas. 👇
This complete walking tour captures the hidden charm, mouth-watering gourmet streets, and sunset secrets of Japan’s premier international hub like you’ve never seen before.

In this walk, we’ll visit several must-see spots
• Haneda Airport Garden: Explore the brand-new shopping and dining paradise, featuring magnificent traditional Yagura displays and top-tier Japanese culinary gems.
• Edo Koji & Traditional Alleyways: Stroll through nostalgic Edo-period streetscapes, iconic indoor Japanese bridges, and vibrant culinary alleys tucked right inside the terminal.
• Observation Deck at Sunset: Experience the breathtaking post-sunset sky overlooking glowing runways, parked aircraft, and planes taking off into the twilight.
Join us on this immersive walking route through Haneda’s grandest spaces, where world-class transit and rich Japanese heritage exist in perfect harmony.

Route Highlights
00:00 Opening / オープニング
00:16 Tokyo Monorail Haneda Airport Terminal 3 Station / 東京モノレール 羽田空港第3ターミナル駅
02:04 Haneda Airport Garden (2F & 1F) / 羽田エアポートガーデン（2F・1F）
08:33 Grand Foyer & Yagura / グランドホワイエ・やぐら
13:22 4F - Hirokoji & Edo Koji) / 4F 広小路・江戸小路
16:39 Edomae Yokocho & Okonomi Yokocho / 江戸前横丁・おこのみ横丁
20:30 Haneda Nihonbashi Bridge / はねだ日本橋
21:47 Festival Plaza & TIAT SKY ROAD (5F) / お祭り広場・TIAT SKY ROAD
23:09 Observation Deck / 展望デッキ

