VALUES (
  'jfF9-um6NL8',
  'Changi Airport Singapore POV - Jewel Waterfall & Terminal Walk | 4K 60fps',
  'Immerse yourself in a relaxing POV walking tour of Singapore Changi Airport, consistently ranked as one of the best airports in the world. Experience the futuristic architecture, the stunning HSBC Rain Vortex waterfall at Jewel, the iconic Skytrain, and the lush indoor Shiseido Forest Valley.

Whether you are looking for a virtual travel experience, aesthetic background ambience, or simply want to explore this architectural marvel, this video brings you right into the heart of Changi.

📱 Shot in high-definition using an iPhone 13 Pro.
🎧 Wear headphones for the best immersive audio experience.


