VALUES (
  'MVxqUzy1cU8',
  '[4K 60P] Walking Tour @ Singapore Changi Airport Terminal 3',
  'Changi Airport Terminal 3 was launched in 2008.
It handles 22 million passengers per year. Flights to Europe, North America, South America, East Asia and Oceania depart from Changi Terminal 3.

It is also the main terminal of Singapore Airlines and home of boarding gates A & B.

Singapore Changi Airport Terminal 3 building has 28 air bridges, 8 of them for large aircraft.

Services and amenities can be found in the basement level, where you can clearly see the Green Wall, which spans across the main building from the basement to the fifth level.

