  '{"id":"4L-1xHDWvRc","title":"🇸🇬 4K HDR | World Best Airport 2025 | Singapore Changi Airport Most Luxurious Terminal Tour","description":"🇸🇬 4K HDR | World Best Airport 2025 | Singapore Changi Airport Most Luxurious Terminal\n\nSingapore Changi Airport has once again been crowned the World’s Best Airport in 2025, marking its 13th win at the prestigious Skytrax World Airport Awards. This recognition highlights its exceptional service, innovative facilities, and commitment to passenger satisfaction.\n\nThe airport is renowned for its seamless travel experience, offering efficient check-ins, arrivals, and security processes. It boasts world-class amenities, including the iconic Jewel Changi Airport, lush indoor gardens, and expansive shopping and dining options. This year, Changi Airport also won awards for World’s Best Airport Dining, World’s Best Airport Washrooms, and Best Airport in Asia, further solidifying its reputation.\n\nChangi Airport serves as a major aviation hub in Southeast Asia, connecting travelers to destinations across the globe. Its strategic design and focus on sustainability make it not just a transit point but a destination in itself4. The airport’s dedication to excellence is reflected in its ability to reclaim the top spot after briefly losing it to Doha’s Hamad International Airport last year.\n\n📍 Location: https://maps.app.goo.gl/iuSqWGVWwmZ2pU8F9\n\nSubscribe to my channel and like this video if you love my works ❤️.\n\nSingapore Virtual Tours -\nhttps://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTlGDHO0L39HjZESQXFD-aa8HBLo0foi3\n\nDriving Tours -\nhttps://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTlGDHO0L39G6YOoswcobleX-DBgImL74\n\nWalking Tours -\nhttps://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTlGDHO0L39FUDA_14_lAFv3NncPwri5p\n\nCycling Tours-\nhttps://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTlGDHO0L39ELofoBOE8EoBOy-8vF8JU4\n\nFollow me on Facebook : https://www.facebook.com/BDW-Travel-726793538124891\n\n⏰ Timeline⏰\n00:00 Intro\n03:41 Singapore Changi Airport\n08:03 Inside Changi Airport Terminal 1 Rest Area\n12:32 Cactus Garden at Changi Airport Terminal 1\n19:55 Skytrain to Terminal 3\n21:33 Changi Airport Terminal 3\n24:39 Butterfly Garden at Changi Airport Terminal 3\n27:11 Rest Area at Changi Airport Terminal 3\n43:58 Skytrain to Changi Airport Terminal 2\n47:36 Changi Airport Terminal 2\n52:27 Sunflower Garden at Changi Airport Terminal 2\n\n#BDW #Singapore #4K #4ktv #travel #travelvlog #hdr #4khdr #8k #8khdr #singapore4k #singapore8k","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4L-1xHDWvRc/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Airport Walks","channel":"BDW Relaxational Travel TV","channelTitle":"BDW Relaxational Travel TV","channelId":"UC3oPoFgj0lFKdgJULyqh5Hg","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2025-04-11T01:00:04Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":10,"evidence":[{"title":"Singapore Changi Airport","startSeconds":221},{"title":"Inside Changi Airport Terminal 1 Rest Area","startSeconds":483},{"title":"Cactus Garden at Changi Airport Terminal 1","startSeconds":752},{"title":"Skytrain to Terminal 3","startSeconds":1195},{"title":"Changi Airport Terminal 3","startSeconds":1293},{"title":"Butterfly Garden at Changi Airport Terminal 3","startSeconds":1479},{"title":"Rest Area at Changi Airport Terminal 3","startSeconds":1631},{"title":"Skytrain to Changi Airport Terminal 2","startSeconds":2638},{"title":"Changi Airport Terminal 2","startSeconds":2856},{"title":"Sunflower Garden at Changi Airport Terminal 2","startSeconds":3147}]}}',
