VALUES (
  'BHAGBmkiQnw',
  'I Spent 24 Hours At The Singapore Airport',
  'Download Opera Browser for free at https://opr.as/01-Opera-browser-safiyanygaard ! Thanks again to Opera for sponsoring this video 🕺🏻

HELLO FRIENDS and welcome to another video!! Have you ever gotten stranded at the airport for extended layover and thought - wow this is really the **worst**? Well, it happens to us all the time. But we have been hearing for years about how amazing the Changi Airport in Singapore is, so while we were visiting Singapore and Malaysia this past summer, we had to go check it out and put it to a thorough 24 hour test - to see if it’s really worth all the hype.

So today’s video is a speed run of all the things we could visit in the “Best Airport in the World” in one day - We did a lot of botanical gardening, shopping, eating, vending machine-ing, swimming, (some) sleeping, and even heavenly wang-ing… the works. What do you guys think? Is this the best airport in the world??

Quick disclaimer - apparently you may now be able to traverse the “Mastercard Walkway” in The Jewel without a mastercard. But when we were there they didn’t let us (!!).

Check out our merch shop here!! https://fiendishbehavior.com

My Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/safiyany/
My TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@safiyany
Tyler''s channel: https://www.youtube.com/@tylerwilliams
Our YouTube Shorts channel: https://www.youtube.com/@safiyashorts

MUSIC
Via AudioNetwork

