VALUES (
  'XaneC7DQ60U',
  '[4K] Relaxing Evening Walk Around Heathrow Airport Terminal 2',
  'Filmed on 22/01/2023

Welcome to this relaxing evening walk and tour of Heathrow Airport Terminal 2, also known as the Queen''s Terminal. This newest terminal at London''s Heathrow Airport boasts a range of shops, restaurants, and services.

Whether you''re a frequent traveller or just curious about one of the world''s busiest airports, this evening walk around Heathrow Airport Terminal 2 is sure to be a calming and enjoyable experience. So sit back, relax, and let''s take a tour of this modern and impressive airport terminal.

Disclaimer:
This video contains a lot of flickering in certain points because the FPS I shot in was too high for the low light inside the airport. I tried my best to get rid of the flickering, but nothing worked :(

I still hope you enjoy the video!
_________________________________________________________________________________________
TIMESTAMPS ⏱️
0:00 Arrivals
6:33 Departures
11:31 Shops & Restaurants (After Security)
22:41 Walking to Gates B31-B49
32:15 B31-B49
____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
