MXH6AoGVXoRWVHo\nUSA Walking Tour Playlist (Miami, Los Angeles, Las Vegas, NYC, etc.) 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL-uSE59HVj4BUOcpV1xQ_-zNYCA0_CApB\n\nCHAPTERS:\n0:00:00 Intro | Preview\n\nPART I: SYDNEY OPERA, ROYAL BOTANIC GARDEN SYDNEY, etc.\n0:24:45 Campbells Cove, Circular Quay\n0:02:45 ABOUT SYDNEY | History of Sydney (OPEN CC for subtitles/description)\n0:13:32 Sydney Harbor Bridge\n0:14:14 Sydney Opera\n0:26:56 Royal Botanic Garden Sydney\n\nPART II: SYDNEY TOWN HALL, QUEEN VICTORIA BUILDING, HYDE PARK, etc.\n0:57:33 George Street Sydney\n0:58:25 Sydney Town Hall\n0:59:45 Queen Victoria Building Shopping Centre\n1:11:57 Bird cages at Angel Place\n1:15:25 Sydney Tower Eye\n1:20:03 Hyde Park\n1:21:32 Saint Mary''s Cathedral\n\nPART III: CHINATOWN, DARLING HARBOUR, BARANGAROO RESERVE\n1:24:07 Chinatown\n1:33:26 Darling Square\n1:46:24 Darling Harbour\n1:55:54 King Street Wharf\n2:00:59 Barangaroo\n2:09:54 Barangaroo Reserve\n\nPART IV: LAVENDER BAY | North Shore of Sydney\n2:21:46 Wendy Whiteley''s Secret Garden\n2:25:52 Lavender Bay\n2:32:54 Luna Park Sydney\n2:36:08 Sydney Harbour Bridge\n2:38:22 Olympic Park with a view of the Sydney Opera House\n\nPART V: BONDI BEACH | Sydney''s Coastal Walk\n2:40:25 Mackenzie’s Point Lookout | Bondi to Bronte Coastal Walk\n2:48:52 Bondi Icebergs POOL\n2:52:04 Panoramic view of Bondi Beach\n2:53:51 Bondi Beach Walk\n\n👍 If you enjoyed this video, please like this video and subscribe to our channel for more awesome content 😊 ♡ THANKS FOR WATCHING ♡\n#sydney #australia #walkingtours\n________\nNo part of this video may be used or reproduced without our written permission.","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_9g4OLdUkvU/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Beach Walking Tours","channel":"HP Walking Tours","channelTitle":"HP Walking Tours","channelId":"UCV2_l3k3JuZwIhiY1H0kSxA","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2025-02-25T16:00:42Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":28,"evidence":[{"titl