VALUES (
  'z9Qks4ipPMg',
  'Capri, Italy 4K Walking Tour 🇮🇹 | Luxury Vibes, Coastal views & Marina Piccola',
  'Experience this Capri, Italy 4K Walking Tour 🇮🇹 featuring luxury vibes, stunning coastal views, and a vibrant atmosphere. Starting along Via Camerelle, famous for its iconic purple flowers draped over stone walls and high-end brand boutiques, we head to Marina Piccola with its crystal-clear blue waters and breathtaking views of the legendary Faraglioni Rocks, catch a dreamlike sunset from the upper terrace, explore the energetic Piazza Umberto I with its lively surrounding alleys, and finish at Marina Grande.
This immersive 4K walking tour captures the authentic charm, bustling island streets, and luxurious lifestyle of Capri with natural ambient sounds and no narration—letting you experience Italy as if you were right there.

📍 Location: Capri, Italy 🇮🇹
🌤 Date: June 2026
🌡 Weather: 29°C | 84.2°F
🎥 Video Quality: 4K Ultra HD
🎧 Audio: Natural ambient sound | No narration

👍 Like & Subscribe for more 4K walking tours, Mediterranean destinations, luxury travel experiences, and European city walks!
🔗 Channel: www.youtube.com/@UCGaLMzdEMwwjghJBSfZlEXQ

☕ Support the channel: buymeacoffee.com/duslintravels

CHAPTERS:

00:00 Capri Highlights
01:40 Via Camerelle
20:11 Marina Piccola Beach & Faraglioni Rocks
28:14 Stunning Sunset in Capri
31:41 Piazza Umberto
50:20 Marina Grande

