VALUES (
  'JN3HwTbtCR4',
  'WALKING TOUR SYDNEY AUSTRALIA | Exploring The Best Parts of Manly Beach | 4KUHD | Binaural 🎧',
  'Watch The Whole Sydney Playlist Here ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLGvGz2BqHXXVl7J7SAWiAauHYSqMIrVs3

Welcome to 4KWalksAllOver! Today, we’re bringing you an exciting and immersive walking tour around this vibrant beach area. This video captures the bustling atmosphere and scenic views in stunning 4K UHD and atmospheric binaural audio, making it a perfect virtual tour for anyone planning a beach vacation.

In this video, it''s a sunny October day and we''re taking a walk around the beachside suburb of Manly.

We start looking over the sheltered waters of Shelly Beach. We then join the throng of pedestrians along Marine Parade, walking past the iconic Fairy Bower pool, and soon reach Manly Beach.

Next we take a look at the Manly Markets on The Corso, and then continue to Cabbage Tree Beach on the harbour side of Manly.

Finally, we follow the shoreline of North Harbour past Freshwater Beach, all the way to North Harbour Reserve where we finish this walk.

Join us as we explore the lively beaches, showcasing people playing volleyball, strolling along the promenades, and discovering some charming green pathways. Imagine yourself soaking in the sights and sounds of this beautiful beach 4k experience.

This walking tour covers 4.5 km and takes 1 hr 11 minutes.

If you enjoy this video, please don’t forget to subscribe and hit the notification bell 🔔 to stay updated with our latest uploads. Share your thoughts in the comments, and let us know which part of this walk was your favorite!

► Please Support 4KWalksAllOver
https://buymeacoffee.com/4kwalksallover

► LIKE AND SUBSCRIBE!
Subscribe to the channel here 👉🏻   https://www.youtube.com/@4KWalksAllOver

📅 Date filmed: October 6th 2025  🌤️ Weather: Mostly Sunny. 24 Deg. C.

