  '4K HDR // Ao Nang Beach Walking Tour in Krabi, Thailand 2022',
  'In today''s virtual walking tour we will walk around Ao Nang Beach and Ao Nang walking street in Krabi, Thailand. This is my favorite province in Thailand with beautiful mountains and amazing beaches. From Ao Nang beach you can take a boat to Railay Beach only 15 mins by longtail boat. This trip I will show you in next video. 🇹🇭 Enjoy! On our channel you can see and discover the most interesting places in Krabi and Thailand.
[Real sounds and footage in 4K HDR 60fps]

Date: November 2022
Time: Around 10 AM

Time Stamps:
00:00 A Quick Preview
00:54 Ao Nang Walking Street
07:20 Ao Nang Beach side
10:15 Sailfish Sculpture
10:50 Ao Nang Beach
25:28 Monkey trail entry
26:07 Ao Nang Beach back to walking street
31:57 Longtail boat service

Camera gear 2022:
iPhone 14 Pro Max
Zhiyun smooth Q3

Recorded with binaural microphones, please adjust the audio volume to your taste.

I will be happy if you decide to SUBSCRIBE my channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/VISUALTHAILAND
Thank you!

