VALUES (
  'Yi-Qnj0bKwg',
  'Nantucket Island Morning Beach Walk (4K) | Binaural Audio -- Relax -- Sleep to Ocean Waves',
  'Peaceful walking tour along Wauwinet Beach on the Island of Nantucket.  Relax, sleep to the sound of the ocean waves.

🎧 This video contains Binaural Audio. Please wear headphones for best immersive experience.

Buy me a coffee ☕

0:00 Start
0:48 Wauwinet Beach
33:50 Quick look at the Nature Preserve
37:15 Walk back down the beach

This video is one of three filmed on Nantucket in August 2023.

People say:
''Wauwinet... and the empty beach... is the "WHY" we come to Nantucket. Seemingly endless miles of shoreline without a soul, nesting shore birds, a multitude of seals, searching for just the right shell at First Point, walking the scalloped beaches between First Point, Second Point, and Third Point, driving along the narrows out to Great Point Lighthouse. Relax. This. THIS is why we come to Nantucket. Wauwinet is the North Point... the North Star.''

🔔 Subscribe for new content weekly! ➡️      ⬅️ click on 🔔, 👍 and share.
💌 - up.there.group@gmail.com
Please do not copy, reproduce, distribute or re-upload any of my content.

#sleep #sleepsounds #ocean #oceanwaves #nantucket #island #relaxing #relax',
