VALUES (
  's-rhii6znMU',
  'Tokyo rainy night walk around Akabane',
  '🕒 07/15 7pm 🌡️ +23℃ 🚶‍♂️5km
I had fun at @NomadicGaijin live stream at Tokyo Akabane and decided to film my own rainy ASMR walk in between.
I started from Akabane station, walked through restaurant street on the eastern side of the train line then went on through the western side, looked around residential area, visited Akabane Hachiman shrine and returned to the eastern side. In the end I walked to Arakawa River. Finished at the river without any dry place around to replace depleted camera battery.
Does it have Blade Runner vibes?
One poor kitty was found 😿.

🗺️ https://rambalac.com/wmap?ll=35.78384256735867%2C139.71968844242224&z=15
🏃‍♂️ https://rambalac.com/act/9207755834

Camera: Sony FX3 https://amzn.to/3yRBsRI
Settings: 4K 60p HLG3, 1/100, MF and AF
Lens: Sony PZ 1635G https://amzn.to/3wVfEDp
Stabilizer: DJI RS3 https://amzn.to/3yfkGdy
Mic: https://amzn.to/35REFlg
ePayment&GPS: Garmin Epix Gen 2 https://amzn.to/3srZhMv

JR Pass: https://click.jrpass.com/SH2z
* JR Pass and Amazon links above are affiliated. Clicking them won''t change the price for you but I will get some reward for promotion.

00:00 Akabane station
10:12 Poor kitty
13:15 Tea time
15:00 Playground
23:30 Long park
29:00 Local park
36:35 Hachiman shrine ⛩️
52:20 Playground with swing
55:54 Arakawa river

#rain #night #Tokyo #4k #japan',
  'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/s-rhii6znMU/maxresdefault.jpg',
  'Night & Rain',
  'Rambalac',
  'Rambalac',
  'UCAcsAE1tpLuP3y7UhxUoWpQ',
  'RAIN 4K',
  '2022-07-24T13:00:14Z',
