VALUES (
  '1_XzrxXnwMM',
  'Paris Evening Walking Tour 🇫🇷 | Night Walk & Bike Ride to the Louvre (7.2M Views) 4K',
  'This evening walking tour will take you through some of the most beautiful streets and neighborhoods in *Paris, France* including *Rue des Barres, Rue des Rosiers,* and the streets streets around *Place Saint-Michel.* The last 20 minutes of the video is a bike ride though the streets of Paris at night.

📅 *Filmed on* Saturday, July 18th, 2020
🕰 *Start time:* 7:38 PM
🌞 *Weather*  29°C | 85°F 🌡
📍 *Location:* Paris, Île-de-France Region, France
🗺️ Map of the Walk: https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/edit?mid=16wQePbC2KRprUMgUlxpOKlGhzIh_BXmo&usp=sharing

🔻𝗩𝗶𝗱𝗲𝗼 𝗧𝗶𝗺𝗲𝗹𝗶𝗻𝗲 𝗟𝗶𝗻𝗸𝘀🔻
0:00 – Intro and Map
1:07 – Place Saint-Michel (Famous Parisian Square)
3:51 – Rue de la Huchette (Lively Dining Street)
8:10 – Rue Saint-Séverin (Historic Latin Quarter)
12:27 – Rue de la Harpe (Quaint Parisian Alley)
15:59 – Cour du Commerce Saint-André (Charming Courtyard)
18:25 – Rue Grégoire de Tours (Classic Parisian Street)
22:39 – Rue des Barres (Beautiful Medieval Street)
25:17 – Rue des Rosiers (Famous Jewish Quarter & Shops)
31:09 – Rue de Rivoli (Elegant Shopping & Architecture)
34:26 – Rue de la Roquette (Bustling Parisian Nightlife)
37:39 – Rue de Lappe (Historic Wine Bars & Cafés)
42:24 – Rue de Charonne (Trendy & Artistic District)
45:50 – Bike Ride Begins (Enjoy the Paris Night Ride!)
50:04 – Courtyard of the Hôtel de Ville (Stunning City Hall)
56:39 – Louvre Pyramid (Iconic Glass Pyramid at Night)
1:01:07 – Seine River (Romantic Night Views)

▶ *Watch Next:* https://youtu.be/fKgP6JGAM_A

