s://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TTWQuWj1-i8\n\nDeep House 4 Hour Greece:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=--CqUrPL_ds&t=176s\n\nDeep House 3 Hour Greek Islands:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cuXW-3Tj_-c\n\nDeep House 5 Hour The Mediterranean:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ticLtwIm4G4&t=719s\n\nBossa Nova in the Caribbean\nhttps://youtu.be/bi91bM_xL-s\n\nWest Crete 5 Hour Piano Relaxation Film:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v4pzhPoXQyc&t=17233s\n\nNight Jazz\nhttps://youtu.be/rEes032cWpg\n\n60 Classical Piano Pieces\nhttps://youtu.be/ueLNDA5Cces\n\nBest Classical Music 2021\nhttps://youtu.be/L2cLKQkQYD0\n\nChicago 1 Hour Relaxation Film:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lIS6J4cNmDg&t=2346s\n\nSan Francisco 1 Hour Relaxation Film:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L1aq01-uxNs&t=891s\n\nMexico City 1 Hour Relaxation Film:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4KBjBvxgwSU\n\nCopyright information:\nWe do not own the commercial licenses of the content used in this video. Downloading and using excerpts or entire videos of our channel is forbidden. However, It is allowed to embed the weblink of the original video in your blogs and websites (no video vlogs!) with reference to our Youtube Channel.\n\nTags:\n#lebanon\n#soothingrelaxation\n#relax\n#chillout\n#chillmusic\n#beirut\n#levante\n#beach\n#piano\n#calm\n#soothing\n#lounge\n#bossanova\n#relax\n#nature\n#soothingmusic\n#relaxingmusic\n#volcano\n#arabic\n#arabicmehndi\n#middleeast\n#libanon\n#baalbek","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/E2t8F3AY9J0/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Drone & Aerial","channel":"Polychronis Film","channelTitle":"Polychronis Film","channelId":"UCqpzY0_0ucWZQ8_LPGDxFtQ","badge":"DRONE 4K","publishedAt":"2022-11-08T22:45:11Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":6,"evidence":[{"title":"Batroun","startSeconds":174},{"title":"Baalbek","startSeconds":806},{"title":"Sannine Mountain","startSeconds":1052},{"title":"Beirut","startSeconds":1193},{"title":"Sayidat Al Qarn Chur