  '[4K] MILAN 🇮🇹 Milano Drone | 1 Hour Aerial of Milano | Lombardia Italy Italia 2025',
  'Milan (Milano, Mailand or Milaan - 2025 4K drone aerial relaxation film) is a city in the state of Lombardia (Lombardy) Northern Italy. The city of Milan has a population of approximately 1,5 million and its region of 4,5 million. Milan is the second largest city in Italy after Rome. Milan is also known because of its soccer teams AC Milan Inter Milan. Although the city was severely bombed during the Second World War the old center still exists and was partly restored. Especially the Duomo Cathedral of Milan is world famous with its Gothic design. The city has a modern appearance though in contrast to many other Italian cities. There is a modern urban area known as Fintech District and the CityLife District. The city is the financial heart of Italy and many multinational have their offices in Milan. Moreover, Milan is also known as the fashion and design city of the world. Lake Como is a touristic area in the north of Milan.

