VALUES (
  'nW2wQhd3h3E',
  '[4K] ROME 🇮🇹 ROMA | 1 Hour Drone Aerial Relaxation | Lazio Vatican Italy Italia',
  'Roma Rome, 1 Hour Drone Scenic Relaxation Aerial of Rome in 4K Ultra HD. A City tour, with highlights, sightseeing and the best of Rome and the top 10 attractions. Rome (or Roma in Italian) is the capital city of Italy. Together with Athens, Rome is generally considered the cradle of the Western Christian Culture. The history of Rome spans a period of more than 2,000 years as it was the capital city of the Roman Empire when it was known as the Eternal City. The city of Rome has almost 3 million citizens. Its metropolitan region in Lazio (Latium) has approximately 5 million inhabitants.

Rome has many outstanding places to visit and is listed as a UNESCO World Heritage Site. Some of the hightlights of the city includes the Vatican City (Vaticano) with the St. Peter''s Cathedral and Square, the Colosseum with the Forum Romanum, the Pantheon and the Spanish Steps. Many buildings were build during the Renaissance and the Baroque period. More than 10 million tourist visit Rome each year.

Music by Matteo de Grandis, Giuliano Poles and Michael Vignola.

