  'Driving Through Germany’s Black Forest 🇩🇪 | Scenic Road to Freiburg 4K',
  'Experience a scenic road trip through Germany’s Black Forest This drive takes you from Geisingen to Freiburg im Breisgau, passing traditional towns, winding forest roads, green valleys and beautiful Schwarzwald landscapes.

📅 Date of Recording: August 2026
📍 Location: Black Forest, Germany 🇩🇪 | Geisingen - Freiburg im Breisgau
☀️ Weather: Sunny 18°C / 64.4°F
🚗 My route is linked here: https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/1/edit?mid=1SYu3tJsIvJSwjbhFyTGta1mKzvvT88w&usp=sharing

Help me reach my first 6,000 subscribers — every bit of support means so much to me ❤️
🔔 Please subscribe:  https://www.youtube.com/@SwissScenicDrives?sub_confirmation=1

00:00 Map with the route
00:09 Intro
