33:00 Titisee
35:27 St Märgen
45:57 Falkensteig
55:27 Freiburg im Breisgau

❗IMPORTANT: Turn on Subtitles (CC) for a guided historical and geographical tour! (Available in multiple languages)
📺 For the best viewing experience, be sure to watch on a big screen or Smart TV.
