VALUES (
  'WhkSN97UvnA',
  '🚴 Scenic Cycling Journey from Brixen to Kiens | 4K GoPro POV | No Music, Just Nature',
  '#SlowTV #VirtualCycling #dolomites
Take a peaceful 1 hour 46 minute virtual bike ride through the breathtaking landscapes of South Tyrol, Italy — filmed on June 1, 2025, under a clear blue sky. This slow-paced e-bike ride starts in the charming old town of Brixen and follows the Pustertal Cycle Path all the way to Kiens, capturing the calm rhythm of nature, scenic riversides, historic landmarks, and mountain views.

🎥 Filmed in 5.3K on a GoPro mounted on the handlebar, exported in crisp 4K UHD for a truly immersive slow TV experience. No music, just the natural ambience — wind, tires, birdsong, and the occasional ripple of the river.

Perfect for:

- Virtual cycling sessions on your exercise bike or treadmill
- Relaxation and ambient TV background in your living room
- Exploring South Tyrol from your couch
- Anyone interested in the Dolomites, Italy, or e-bike travel

🎥 Our Filming Gear & Setup*
Many of you ask how we capture these immersive 4K scenic views and how we achieve such  smooth and stable footage while riding. Here is the equipment we use to bring these rides to your home:

Primary Cameras:
🔹 The Main View: GoPro HERO 13 Black — https://amzn.to/4s10lDy
🔹 Ultra-Wide FOV: GoPro Ultra Wide Lens Mod — https://amzn.to/46MGhfv
🔹 360° Immersive Cam: GoPro MAX 2 — https://amzn.to/4cVH9m3
🔹 Cinematic Scenery: Canon R6 Mark II — https://amzn.to/4dcCsnH
🔹 Canon Lens : Canon RF28-70mm F2.8 is STM  — https://amzn.to/4szlOmD
🔹 Mobile 4K Gear: iPhone 17 Pro Max — https://amzn.to/4bwth0e

Audio & Stability:
🔹 ASMR Nature Sounds: Zoom H1essential Recorder — https://amzn.to/4b0Dylg
🔹 Rock-Solid Handlebar Mount: https://amzn.to/4budi2J
🔹 Immersive Neck Mount : https://amzn.to/4ljAjZp
🔹 Smooth Motion Gimbal: GoPro Fluid Pro  — https://amzn.to/4ukywr4
🔹 Travel Tripod : NEEWER Travel Tripod — https://amzn.to/4b0KnDo

Essential Power:
🔹 High-Capacity Powerbank: https://amzn.to/4byXFqE
*Werbung / Advertising:
The Amazon links above are affiliate links. If you buy something through these links, we receive a small commission at no extra cost to you. This is a great way to support our family channel and help us create more 4K rides for you! Thank you so much for your support! 🙏🏼

(As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. / Als Amazon-Partner verdiene ich an qualifizierten Verkäufen.)

🌍 Route on Komoot:
https://www.komoot.com/de-de/tour/2434515855

🕒 Chapters / Key Locations
00:00 Start in Brixen Old Town
13:08 Eisack River Cycle Path through Brixen
37:35 Fortezza Fortress
01:00:37 Mühlbach (Rio di Pusteria) Village
01:09:14 Mühlbacher Klause Castle
01:18:11 Scenic Rienz River & Pustertal
01:26:29 Pustertal Cycle Path to Ehrenburg
01:45:21 Arrival in Kiens

🌿 Filming Notes:

- Date: June 1, 2025
- Weather: Mostly sunny with occasional white clouds, ~22–24 °C
- Camera: GoPro Hero 12 (5.3K, handlebar-mounted)
- Format: Slow TV, no cuts, no music
- Pace: Relaxed e-bike cruising

📺 For the best experience, watch on a large screen or smart TV and let the sounds of nature take you on a journey through the Alps.

🔗 More peaceful rides and virtual cycling videos on our channel:
👉 https://www.youtube.com/@VirtualCyclingWorkouts

