nEssential Power:\n🔹 High-Capacity Powerbank: https://amzn.to/4byXFqE\n*Werbung / Advertising:\nThe Amazon links above are affiliate links. If you buy something through these links, we receive a small commission at no extra cost to you. This is a great way to support our family channel and help us create more 4K rides for you! Thank you so much for your support! 🙏🏼\n\n(As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. / Als Amazon-Partner verdiene ich an qualifizierten Verkäufen.)\n\n🌍 Route on Komoot:\nhttps://www.komoot.com/de-de/tour/2434515855\n\n🕒 Chapters / Key Locations\n00:00 Start in Brixen Old Town\n13:08 Eisack River Cycle Path through Brixen\n37:35 Fortezza Fortress\n01:00:37 Mühlbach (Rio di Pusteria) Village\n01:09:14 Mühlbacher Klause Castle\n01:18:11 Scenic Rienz River & Pustertal\n01:26:29 Pustertal Cycle Path to Ehrenburg\n01:45:21 Arrival in Kiens\n\n🌿 Filming Notes:\n\n- Date: June 1, 2025\n- Weather: Mostly sunny with occasional white clouds, ~22–24 °C\n- Camera: GoPro Hero 12 (5.3K, handlebar-mounted)\n- Format: Slow TV, no cuts, no music\n- Pace: Relaxed e-bike cruising\n\n📺 For the best experience, watch on a large screen or smart TV and let the sounds of nature take you on a journey through the Alps.\n\n🔗 More peaceful rides and virtual cycling videos on our channel:\n👉 https://www.youtube.com/@VirtualCyclingWorkouts\n\n#SlowTV #VirtualCycling #Dolomites #GoProRide #Pustertal #EbikeAdventure #NatureSounds #4KRelaxation","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WhkSN97UvnA/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"POV Rides","channel":"Virtual Cycling Workouts","channelTitle":"Virtual Cycling Workouts","channelId":"UCbQiCVLFtWLOjVO0YuUqo7Q","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2025-08-04T12:45:06Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":8,"evidence":[{"title":"Start in Brixen Old Town","startSeconds":0},{"title":"Eisack River Cycle Path through Brixen","startSeconds":788},{"title":"Fortezza Fortress","startSeconds":2255},{"title":"Mühlbach (Rio di Pusteria) Village","startSeconds":3637},{"title":"Mühlbacher Klause Castle","startSeconds":4154},{"title":"Scenic Rienz River & Pustertal","startSeconds":4691},{"title":"Pustertal Cycle Path to Ehrenburg","startSeconds":5189},{"title":"Arrival in Kiens","startSeconds":6321}]}}',
