1:39:31 – 🌊 Coastal road during sunset
1:42:28 – 🔭 Miradouro das Quebradas
1:44:01 – 🔦 Waterfalls & Cave Tunnel
1:45:04 – 🌴 Fajã da Areia

🔔 Subscribe for More Scenic Adventures: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCko097VBUlDAjEyA_vWvwVw?sub_confirmation=1

