  'Old Town of Bergamo, Italy Walking Tour - 4K 60fps',
  'Welcome to Bergamo, citta Alta. An old town on a hill surrounded by the UNESCO heritage Venetian walls.

Walk with us through the historic streets of old Bergamo through the wall down to the modern city.
Make sure to SUBSCRIBE to stay in the loop with our weekly updates! We invest a lot into making smooth camera movements and non-shaky walking for a soothing viewing experience. If you like what you see, please LIKE the video so more people can discover.

Featured locations:

