VALUES (
  'kOBZn7GgnGc',
  'Alicante, Spain Walking Tour - Beach, Marina, Old Town and Historic Center 4K',
  'Explore Alicante, Spain in this 1 hour 38 minute daytime walking tour through the city’s waterfront, beach area, historic center, old town streets, and lively urban spaces, filmed in 4K with real ambient sound and no talking. This calm and historic walk captures the Mediterranean atmosphere of Alicante with palm trees, sea views, cafés, restaurants, shops, people, boats, architecture, narrow streets, and the natural sound of the city.

The route includes Esplanada d’Espanya, Fuente de la Plaza del Mar, Alicante Marina, Postiguet Beach, and views of Santa Bárbara Castle before continuing into the historic center around Plaça de l’Ajuntament and the Old Town. The walk also passes Soho Parc Alicante, C. Bailén, Mercado Central, Rambla Méndez Núñez, Calle de las Setas, and Cocatedral de Sant Nicolau, showing a mix of elegant streets, local life, shopping areas, historic façades, and everyday movement through the center of Alicante.

This video also captures a teachers’ protest along the route, adding a real local moment to the walk, before continuing through the second part of the Old Town and finishing around Basílica de Santa Maria. Enjoy this Alicante walking tour in 4K with real ambient sounds only — no talking, no narration, just the natural atmosphere of the beach, marina, city streets, historic squares, and old town of Alicante.

Chapters

00:00 Intro
00:33 Esplanada d’Espanya
10:53 Fuente de la Plaza del Mar
12:15 Alicante Marina
18:21 Postiguet Beach
30:50 Santa Bárbara Castle views
45:23 Plaça de l’Ajuntament
47:19 Old Town Alicante
