VALUES (
  'Tlqv2y69Wgo',
  'POMPEII, Italy 4K Walking Tour | UNESCO World Heritage with Captions [4K Ultra HD/60fps]',
  'Indulge in this curated 4K, 60fps walking tour of UNESCO''s Pompeii archaeological area, Italy, featuring the ancient city''s stunningly preserved ruins and historical landmarks 🎧 Best with headphones for an immersive experience (ASMR - Binaural City Sound). ⬇ LINKS to the full videos, chapters, etc. ⬇ Set beneath the shadow of Mount Vesuvius, Pompeii’s ancient streets hold a timeless allure. Once a bustling Roman city, it met an untimely end with the eruption of Vesuvius in 79 A.D., which preserved its buildings, artwork, and even daily life in a stunning, ash-covered tomb. Hidden beneath layers of ash for over 1,500 years, it was rediscovered in the 18th century, unveiling an extraordinary snapshot of the past. Today, Pompeii is one of Italy’s most famous archaeological sites, a mesmerizing destination that reveals the grandeur of Roman life frozen in time. Here’s your guide to Pompeii’s top attractions, each one offering a glimpse into the culture, innovation, and artistry of the Roman Empire. [Filmed in June 2024]

🗺 Google Maps of this tour 👉 https://hpst.me/WT/Pompeii
ℹ️💁‍♂️ Turn ON the Closed Captions to discover information on attractions, historical facts, and more (Open CC for subtitles). Enjoy!

Watch also:
• ROME, Italy Walking Tour 👉 https://youtu.be/ot-HMv_PKs0?si=yYmzPWP_gKcKrM2R
• AMALFI Coast & Bay of NAPLES Walking Tour 👉 https://youtu.be/8DgYH9OXARI?si=otEheU18AXnWTMA7
• ATHENS Acropolis (Parthenon, etc.) Walking Tour 👉 https://youtu.be/n_hx_rQQ6sw?si=GUAgvyJvNgMyh1Iu&t=9128
• EUROPE Walking Tour Playlist (Paris, Barcelona, London, etc.) 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL-uSE59HVj4Ah5kaHKApFBm_Wh2mZ_KWd
• ASIA Walking Tour Playlist (Bali, Tokyo, Bangkok, etc.) 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL-uSE59HVj4A2IB8EOMXH6AoGVXoRWVHo
• USA Walking Tour Playlist (Miami, Los Angeles, Las Vegas, NYC, etc.) 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL-uSE59HVj4BUOcpV1xQ_-zNYCA0_CApB

