YC, etc.) 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL-uSE59HVj4BUOcpV1xQ_-zNYCA0_CApB\n\nCHAPTERS:\n0:00:00 INTRO | Preview\n0:00:31 Animation path of this walking tour\n0:00:51 Foro di Pompei\n0:03:14 Temple of Jupiter (Pompeii) | Tempio di Giove\n0:04:57 About Pompeii | HISTORY OF POMPEII (Open CC for description/subtitles)\n0:09:40 Santuario di Apollo\n0:17:43 Mount Vesuvius\n0:20:28 Around the Antiquarium di Pompei\n0:27:54 The House of the Geometric Mosaics | Casa Dei Mosaici Geometrici\n0:31:35 Centauro sculpture by Igor Mitoraj\n0:36:43 Orto Botanica\n0:41:31 POMPEII PANORAMIC VIEWS: The Foro Triangolare | Triangular Forum\n0:41:58 Teatro Grande Pompeii\n0:43:31 Quadriporticus of the theatres | Quadriportico dei Teatri\n0:46:13 Teatro Piccolo Pompeii (Odeon)\n0:51:19 Casa dei Ceii Pompeii (vibrant frescoes)\n0:57:37 Casa di Paquio Proculo\n1:01:06 House of Menander\n1:09:53 Via di Castricio Street\n1:16:26 Amphitheatre of Pompeii\n1:18:27 Amphitheatre of Pompeii from the inside\n1:25:46 Praedia di Giulia Felice Villa and Garden Complex\n1:40:10 Stabian Baths Ancient Roman Bathing Complex | Terme Stabiane\n2:03:55 House of the Faun\n2:09:37 Macellum Market\n2:10:36 Portico della Concordia Augusta and Building of Eumachia\n2:00:00 Temple of Give\n2:00:00 Foro di Pompei\n\n👍 If you enjoyed this video, please like this video and subscribe to our channel for more awesome content 😊 ♡ THANKS FOR WATCHING ♡\n#pompeii #UNESCO #walkingtours\n________\nNo part of this video may be used or reproduced without our written permission.","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Tlqv2y69Wgo/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Museums & Culture","channel":"HP Walking Tours","channelTitle":"HP Walking Tours","channelId":"UCV2_l3k3JuZwIhiY1H0kSxA","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2024-11-26T16:00:23Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":27,"evidence":[{"title":"INTRO | Preview","startSeconds":0},{"title":"Animation path of this walking tour","startSeconds":31