VALUES (
  'xUphsn5b1w8',
  'Wonders of India | Most Amazing Places in India | 4K Travel Guide',
  'Discover the wonders of India in this spectacular documentary! A journey through the most beautiful places in India, from the peaks of the Indian Himalayas to ancient temples, from the deserts of Rajasthan to the backwaters of Kerala.

What to see in India:
In this video we explore over 40 must-see places throughout the subcontinent. From the legendary Taj Mahal to sacred cities like Varanasi, from the colorful palaces of Jaipur and Jodhpur to the remote valleys of Ladakh and Spiti. Discover the wonders of Kerala with Alleppey and Varkala, the suspended monasteries of Sikkim, the waterfalls of Meghalaya, to the ruins of Hampi and the Ellora Caves.

Top places in India in the video:
Iconic temples and monuments
Himalayan valleys over 4000 meters
Breathtaking landscapes
Remote villages and ancient traditions
Deserts, sacred lakes and rainforests

This documentary guides you through the most extraordinary places in India, perfect for planning your trip. Discover wonderful India through spectacular images and fascinating stories.
An unforgettable journey through the wonders of India that will leave you breathless!

