iffs of Suduroy.\n\nGreenland: A Land of Ice and Epic Adventures ❄️\nJourney to Greenland, where vast glaciers and vibrant Inuit culture await.\n\nIlulissat and the Icefjord: Greenland''s Frozen Masterpiece 🧊\nWitness the natural wonder of Ilulissat Icefjord, a UNESCO World Heritage marvel of ice and light.\n\n*****************************************************************************\n\nTime Code:\n00:00 Welcome to the World''s Happiest Country\n02:02 Copenhagen\n07:47 Kronborg Castle\n09:52 Frederiksborg Castle\n11:52 The Infinite Bridge\n13:26 Aarhus\n15:54 Aarhus Cathedral\n17:24 Grenen\n19:01 Tranekaer Castle\n19:54 Kolstrup Church\n21:09 Ribe\n23:04 Faroe Islands\n24:51 Coastal Marvels: Múlafossur Waterfall, Drangarnir & Lake Sørvágsvatn\n26:59 Myths and Isolation: Trøllkonufingur & Mykines Island\n28:14 Legends and Villages: Gjógv and Kalsoy\n30:01 Myths and Cliffs: Risin and Kellingin & Suduroy\n31:59 Greenland\n33:20 Ilulissat and the Icefjord: Greenland''s Frozen Marvel","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1oa1hi_Ib4g/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Documentaries","channel":"Pathfinders Travel","channelTitle":"Pathfinders Travel","channelId":"UC_QWXkR6Sbztc6tcmpZNTvw","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2024-12-15T14:44:18Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":18,"evidence":[{"title":"Welcome to the World''s Happiest Country","startSeconds":0},{"title":"Copenhagen","startSeconds":122},{"title":"Kronborg Castle","startSeconds":467},{"title":"Frederiksborg Castle","startSeconds":592},{"title":"The Infinite Bridge","startSeconds":712},{"title":"Aarhus","startSeconds":806},{"title":"Aarhus Cathedral","startSeconds":954},{"title":"Grenen","startSeconds":1044},{"title":"Tranekaer Castle","startSeconds":1141},{"title":"Kolstrup Church","startSeconds":1194},{"title":"Ribe","startSeconds":1269},{"title":"Faroe Islands","startSeconds":1384},{"title":"Coastal Marvels: Múlafossur Waterfall, Drangarnir & Lake Sørvágsvatn","startSeconds":14