VALUES (
  'aAeFEwI0zTs',
  'Istanbul 4K 🇹🇷 Eminonu to Karakoy Walk: Galata Bridge & Trendy Cafes | Bosphorus Waterfront & Hotels',
  'Istanbul 4K Bosphorus walking tour from Eminonu to Karakoy via Galata Bridge. Explore luxury 5-star hotels (Peninsula, JW Marriott), Bosphorus waterfront, Fransız Sokağı & trendy Karaköy cafes.

Welcome to the ultimate Istanbul walking tour experience during a warm summer vacation in Turkey Istanbul. This immersive Istanbul travel guide takes you on a scenic walk starting from historic Eminönü Square and the iconic New Mosque (Yeni Cami). Crossing the historic Galata Bridge over the Golden Horn, you will experience authentic local life, waterfront fine dining restaurants, scenic Bosphorus views, and bustling ferries.

Moving along the Bosphorus waterfront in the historic Beyoğlu district, the route showcases luxury travel destination spots including 5-star hotels like The Peninsula Istanbul and JW Marriott Istanbul Bosphorus, with views of the iconic Galata Tower. Continuing into Karaköy, explore boutique shopping along Fransız Sokağı (French Street) and Mumhane Street, famous for specialty coffee, vibrant Karaköy cafes, Turkish street food, and fish sandwiches. If you are planning your turkey travel itinerary, these travel tips will help you discover both historic landmarks and modern luxury lifestyle in Istanbul.

🔔 Don''t miss our next immersive walking tour exploring Istanbul''s most beautiful neighborhoods, luxury destinations, hidden gems and authentic local life. Subscribe now and turn on notifications so you never miss a new journey.
🔗 https://www.youtube.com/@walkwithme.3

📢 Privacy Notice: This video is filmed in public spaces to document the city''s daily life and architecture. If you appear in this footage and prefer to have your image blurred or removed, please contact me via the comments or channel email, and your request will be processed immediately.

🎥 Video Information 🎥
Format: 4K Ultra HD HDR — Real Binaural Sound
📷 Camera: OSMO Action 5 Pro (4K 60fps) @DJI
🎧 Experience: No talking — Immersive city ambience
📍 Location: Eminönü & Karaköy, Istanbul, Turkey
📅 Date: Summer 2026

