VALUES (
  'erNavODRNtg',
  'Soekarno-Hatta International Airport T3: Complete Walkthrough from Entry to Departure | Indonesia 4K',
  'In this video
00:00 Intro
00:05 Entry
01:08 Check-in Counters
02:55 Start of Walking Tour
10:45 Garuda Indonesia Customer Service
11:10 Restaurants
17:15 Entry to International Departures (Keberangkatan Internasional)
17:50 Immigration Gates
19:00 Inside the International Departures Area
20:10 Plaza Bali Duty Free
21:05 Boarding Gates
25:10 Boarding
26:50 Inside the Plane (Garuda Indonesia)

Join me on a complete walkthrough of Soekarno-Hatta International Airport Terminal 3 as I prepare to fly to Singapore with Garuda Indonesia. From entry, check-in, and security checks to the boarding gates, this video captures every detail of the passenger experience at Indonesia''s premier airport. Terminal 3 offers modern facilities, spacious lounges, and a seamless travel experience for both local and international flights.

Whether you’re a traveler planning your next trip or simply curious about Soekarno-Hatta Airport, this video will provide a firsthand look at the terminal''s highlights and amenities.

(INDONESIAN): Ikuti perjalanan lengkap di Terminal 3 Bandara Soekarno-Hatta saat saya bersiap terbang ke Singapura dengan Garuda Indonesia. Mulai dari pintu masuk, check-in, pemeriksaan keamanan, hingga pintu keberangkatan, video ini menangkap setiap detail pengalaman penumpang di bandara terbaik Indonesia. Terminal 3 menawarkan fasilitas modern, lounge yang luas, dan pengalaman perjalanan yang nyaman untuk penerbangan domestik maupun internasional.

