VALUES (
  'gcF36GVqdOM',
  '🇨🇦 Inside Toronto Pearson Terminal 3 (Canada''s Busiest Airport) | Full Walking Tour 4K HDR',
  'Explore the world with me at Canada’s largest and busiest travel hub! ✈️🇨🇦

Step inside Toronto Pearson International Airport (YYZ) Terminal 3 Departures for this immersive 4K walking tour. As Toronto gets ready to welcome the world for FIFA 2026, this complete walkthrough shows you exactly what it''s like to navigate the main international terminal.

Join me as we explore the Terminal 3 check-in area, departures hall, airport signage, passenger walkways, and the high-end duty-free shopping. We’ll also walk past the gates and lounges to capture the true, busy atmosphere of international travel.

Whether you’re flying from YYZ Terminal 3 with WestJet, Delta, or Air Transat, or you''re an aviation fan who enjoys relaxing airport ambience, luggage sounds, and real terminal life, this tour is for you. This walk features crisp, ASMR-style sounds for a true "being there" experience.

📽️ Recorded: 13 Aug 2024
📍Location: Toronto Pearson International Airport, Terminal 3, Ontario, Canada
🛫 Airport Code: YYZ

If you enjoy airport walks, Canada travel videos, 4K virtual tours, and real travel ambience, please like, comment, and subscribe for more walking tour videos: https://www.youtube.com/@CluelessNomads

❤️ Subscribe and leave a comment saying ''I subscribed'' and we''ll personally reply to your comment. 💬

Now, sit back, relax, and enjoy the walk!

