VALUES (
  'r11kS1unliM',
  'SAN DIEGO, California 4K Walking Tour | BEACH WALK & SUNSET City Walk with Captions [4K/60fps]',
  'Immerse yourself in this stunning 4K, 60fps walking tour of San Diego, a vibrant coastal city in Southern California known for its stunning beaches, world-class attractions like the San Diego Zoo and USS Midway, and its rich cultural and naval history. 🎧 Best with headphones for an immersive experience (ASMR - Binaural City Sound). ⬇ LINKS to the full videos, chapters, etc. San Diego is a picturesque coastal city in Southern California, renowned for its year-round pleasant weather, beautiful beaches, and diverse cultural offerings. It boasts iconic attractions such as the world-famous San Diego Zoo, Balboa Park, and the historic USS Midway Museum, as well as vibrant neighborhoods like the Gaslamp Quarter and Old Town. The city is a hub for outdoor enthusiasts, offering opportunities for surfing, hiking, and sailing, while its rich naval history and proximity to the Mexican border add unique dimensions to its character. San Diego''s laid-back atmosphere, combined with its bustling downtown and strong ties to innovation and the military, make it a dynamic and inviting destination.  [Filmed in September 2024]

🗺 Google Maps of this tour 👉 https://hpst.me/SanDiegoWT
ℹ️💁‍♂️ Turn ON the Closed Captions to discover information on attractions, historical facts, and more (Open CC for subtitles). Enjoy!

Watch also:
• LOS ANGELES, California Walking Tour 👉 https://youtu.be/VINOSu5y4ic?si=zjAFQ-VabteaHZTI
• MIAMI, Florida Walking Tour 👉 https://youtu.be/7qz13Chz_84?si=GUVaeIDo40MyJ4dQ
• BALI, Indonesia Walking Tour 👉 https://youtu.be/b4VLlbM_qHI?si=VsE29CKAJkKRpBCb
• EUROPE Walking Tour Playlist (Capri, Paris, Barcelona, etc.) 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL-uSE59HVj4Ah5kaHKApFBm_Wh2mZ_KWd
• ASIA Walking Tour Playlist (Bali, Tokyo, Bangkok, etc.) 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL-uSE59HVj4A2IB8EOMXH6AoGVXoRWVHo

