  'Ka''anapali Beach, Maui Walking Tour [4K 60fps] - with Captions',
  'Experience the beauty of Ka''anapali Beach on Maui, Hawaii with this 4K walking tour. Watch in stunning 60fps with captions to enhance your viewing experience!
☕️Buy us a coffee and help support our channel. https://buymeacoffee.com/holoholocrk


