We will start on the south end of the Kāʻanapali Beachwalk, walking north and through the Whalers Village shopping center. Then continuing north through the Sheraton Resort, the Royal Lahaina Resort and ending at Kahekili Beach Park (Airport Beach).

👀 Turn ON the Closed Captions (CC) for interesting facts and history.

