VALUES (
  'IS37Z447Ilc',
  'Old Town Alexandria Virginia Walking Tour - Travel Vlog [4K]',
  'Old Town Alexandria Virginia Walking Tour - Travel Vlog [4K]

Walking tour on a busy & beautiful day of Old Town''s Waterfront, King Street shops/restaurants & Market Square/Old Town Farmer''s Market.

Old Town Alexandria,  marked by cobblestone streets and 18th-century townhouses, is the third-oldest historic district in the nation and has been bustling with activity since it was founded in 1749.  King Street is a walkable mile of centuries-old architecture and the heart of Old Town’s 200+ independently owned restaurants and boutiques.  The Waterfront is a great place for a stroll and to take in picturesque views of the Potomac River and Washington DC.  Old Town Alexandria is a short 30 minute drive from Washington DC.

