  '{"id":"IS37Z447Ilc","title":"Old Town Alexandria Virginia Walking Tour - Travel Vlog [4K]","description":"Old Town Alexandria Virginia Walking Tour - Travel Vlog [4K]\n\nWalking tour on a busy & beautiful day of Old Town''s Waterfront, King Street shops/restaurants & Market Square/Old Town Farmer''s Market.\n\nOld Town Alexandria,  marked by cobblestone streets and 18th-century townhouses, is the third-oldest historic district in the nation and has been bustling with activity since it was founded in 1749.  King Street is a walkable mile of centuries-old architecture and the heart of Old Town’s 200+ independently owned restaurants and boutiques.  The Waterfront is a great place for a stroll and to take in picturesque views of the Potomac River and Washington DC.  Old Town Alexandria is a short 30 minute drive from Washington DC.\n\n👇 To Subscribe!!\nhttps://cutt.ly/HTuZodh\n\nHope you enjoy today''s video, Please show your support by just liking and subscribing to the channel so we can grow a strong and powerful community.\n\nActivate the 🔔 beside the subscribe button to get the notification!📩 If you have any questions or requests feel free to leave them in the comments below.\n\nThank you for watching and see you in the next video!!\n\n⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢\n🎬CHECK OUT OTHER VIDEOS:👇\n➥https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oWQaF7u2Xz4\n➥https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H3mmZmqV3RQ\n➥https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9RKawh0rAGU&t=600s\n➥https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IS37Z447Ilc&t=1475s\n➥https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1uLn8-YX8IU&t=839s\n➥https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wGfHiy1uSyE&t=914s\n➥https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W1SP7J8xjEA&t=125s\n➥https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rNyXOK_quQ4&t=174s\n⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢ ⇢\n\n\nTime Lapse:\n0:00 Waterfront\n17:25 King Street\n23:23 Market Square/Farmers Market\n28:33 King Street\n\n\n🔎RELEVANT HASHTAGS:\n#oldtown #oldtownalexandria #alexandriawalktour #walktour #travelvlog #travelguide #travel #historicalplaces #visitplaces #oldtownwaterfront #kingstreet #kingstreetalexandria","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IS37Z447Ilc/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Museums & Culture","channel":"EMan Walks Travel Videos","channelTitle":"EMan Walks Travel Videos","channelId":"UCtJiIysUzCtEmiRWQhxdrfQ","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2021-10-02T20:01:20Z","admission":{"version":1,"status":"accepted","uniqueEvidenceCount":3,"evidence":[{"title":"Waterfront","startSeconds":0},{"title":"King Street","startSeconds":1045},{"title":"Market Square/Farmers Market","startSeconds":1403}]}}',
