VALUES (
  'dbutbp5GyCY',
  'The Peloponnese: The Land That Made Greece | Full 4K Travel Documentary',
  'Discover the Peloponnese, the peninsula where ancient Greece actually happened. This 4K travel documentary journeys from the vertical cut of the Corinth Canal to the Cyclopean walls of Mycenae, beneath the empty plain where Sparta once stood, and into the nine kilometers of stone that Ancient Messene built so it could never be enslaved again. Along the way, discover a theatre where a whispered word carries fourteen thousand seats, a black waterfall the gods swore their oaths upon, and a rock in the sea with a whole medieval town hidden on its far side. One of the last great historical landscapes still overlooked, still empty, still waiting to be found. This is the Peloponnese, the forgotten heartland of Greece.

🌍 Hi, I''m Hendrik from VoyagersTV. If you''d like to support the channel and help make more films like this possible, consider becoming a "World Voyager" — members get early access to upcoming documentary specials or other perks: 👉 https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfVliFOh-FXnmRdftFjg6zw/join

Planning your next trip to Greece? These are the exact tools I personally use to save money on flights, hotels, and activities — and to stay comfortable while exploring the world.
👉  https://www.voyagers.one/travel-tools/

