  '[4k] Treadmill Running Scenery | 1 Hour Virtual Run | Miami Beach, Florida',
  'Enjoy 1 hour of treadmill workout scenery for a virtual run on Miami Beach, Florida! Get a motivation boost on your treadmill or other exercise machine with scenery from a beautiful summer morning run in South Florida! Starting at Allison Park, this run heads South on the Atlantic Way Path and Miami Beach Ocean Walk, with a couple of excursions onto Collins Ave and W 44th St for construction.

