VALUES (
  'YHIn7d29JhA',
  'WALKING TOUR SYDNEY AUSTRALIA | Crowded Bondi Beach On a Hot & Sunny Day | 4KUHD | Binaural 🎧',
  'Watch The Whole Sydney Playlist Here ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLGvGz2BqHXXVl7J7SAWiAauHYSqMIrVs3

Welcome to 4KWalksAllOver! Today, we''re bringing you an exciting and immersive walk around Bondi Beach and its vibrant streets. This video captures the lively atmosphere and beautiful sights of Bondi in stunning 4K UHD, making it a perfect virtual walk. Join us as we explore, highlighting different areas and scenic points, offering an exciting walking experience.

In this video, it''s a hot and sunny January day and Bondi Beach is filled to the brim with Australia Day long weekend crowds.

We start this walk at  Biddigal Reserve at North Bondi. We stroll along the promenade passing the Children''s Pool and Surf Club and then continue past the Bondi Pavilion all the way to South Bondi and Bondi Icebergs.

Here we turn back to do a lap of the shopping strip along Campbell Parade and take a look at bustling Bondi Markets. Then we enter the back streets of Bondi, eventually climbing the hill all the way to Bondi Rd.

Next we follow Bondi Rd downhill towards the beach, where we once more rejoin the promenade and walk back to North Bondi, where we finish this walk.

Join us as we explore the lively beaches, showcasing people playing volleyball, strolling along the promenades, and discovering some charming green pathways. Imagine yourself soaking in the sights and sounds of this beautiful beach 4k experience.

This walking tour covers 7.1 km and takes 1 hr  45 minutes.

If you enjoy this video, please don’t forget to subscribe and hit the notification bell 🔔 to stay updated with our latest uploads. Share your thoughts in the comments, and let us know which part of this walk was your favorite!

► Please Support 4KWalksAllOver on Patreon or BuyMeACoffee. Your generous donation, no matter how small, helps me bring more videos to you by paying for petrol, public transport fares, etc etc

Patreon:  https://https://www.patreon.com/cw/4KWalksAllOver
BuyMeACoffee:  buymeacoffee.com/4kwalksallover

► LIKE AND SUBSCRIBE!
