VALUES (
  'JgIPCer-OtE',
  'WALKING TOUR SYDNEY AUSTRALIA | Watson''s Bay & Sydney''s Coolest Harbour Beach | 4KUHD | Binaural 🎧',
  'Watch The Whole Sydney Playlist Here ► https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLGvGz2BqHXXVl7J7SAWiAauHYSqMIrVs3

Welcome to 4KWalksAllOver! Today, we''re bringing you an exciting and immersive walk around beautiful Watsons Bay & secluded Camp Cove . This video captures the lively atmosphere and beautiful sights of Watsons Bay in stunning 4K UHD, making it a perfect virtual walk. Join us as we explore, highlighting different areas and scenic points, offering an exciting walking experience.

In this video, it''s a hot and sunny January day and Watsons Bay is filled to the brim with Australia Day long weekend crowds.

We start this walk at  Watsons Bay Baths where we see some local teenagers cooling off, then we move on to Watsons Bay Wharf with a ferry about to depart for Circular Quay.

Next, we pass famous Doyles on the Beach seafood restaurant, and traverse the length of Watson Bay beach, before we head into the residential streets of the suburb. We then walk around Green Point, passing the First Landing Obelisk, before we slip down the stairs onto Camp Cove Beach.

Here make a lap of the beach which is absolutely packed with bathers, and then walk back through the streets of Watson Bay to the cliffs at The Gap. We follow the pathway through Gap Park all the way to Jacobs Ladder Lookout, and then return to Watsons Bay via Don Ritchie Grove and Robertson Park.

We retrace our steps along Marine Parade back to Watsons Bay Baths, where we finish this walk.

Join us as we explore the lively beaches, showcasing swimming, strolling along the promenades, and discovering some charming green pathways. Imagine yourself soaking in the sights and sounds of this beautiful beach 4k experience.

This walking tour covers 4.3 km and takes 1 hr  5 minutes.

If you enjoy this video, please don’t forget to subscribe and hit the notification bell 🔔 to stay updated with our latest uploads. Share your thoughts in the comments, and let us know which part of this walk was your favorite!

► Please Support 4KWalksAllOver on Patreon or BuyMeACoffee. Your generous donation, no matter how small, helps me bring more videos to you by paying for petrol, public transport fares, etc etc

