hit the notification bell 🔔 to stay updated with our latest uploads. Share your thoughts in the comments, and let us know which part of this walk was your favorite!\n\n► Please Support 4KWalksAllOver on Patreon or BuyMeACoffee. Your generous donation, no matter how small, helps me bring more videos to you by paying for petrol, public transport fares, etc etc\n\nPatreon:  https://https://www.patreon.com/cw/4KWalksAllOver\nBuyMeACoffee:  buymeacoffee.com/4kwalksallover\n\n► LIKE AND SUBSCRIBE!\nSubscribe to the channel here 👉🏻   https://www.youtube.com/@4KWalksAllOver\n\n📅 Date filmed: January 25th 2026  🌤️ Weather: Hot & Sunny. 37 Deg. C.\n\n𝗙𝗼𝗹𝗹𝗼𝘄 𝗺𝘆 𝘀𝗼𝗰𝗶𝗮𝗹𝘀\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/4kwalksallover/\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/WalksAllOver/\n\n𝗖𝗵𝗮𝗽𝘁𝗲𝗿𝘀\n00:00 - Preview\n01:52 - Map & Route Overview\n02:15 - Start of Walk at Watsons Bay Baths\n04:37 - Marine Parade\n05:41 - Watsons Bay Beach\n08:01 - Watsons Bay Wharf\n11:13 - Doyles on the Beach Restaurant\n12:45 - Watsons Bay Beach\n13:51 - Cove St\n14:31 - Pacific St\n18:25 - Green Point Walking Track\n20:00 - First Landing Obelisk\n21:54 - Camp Cove Beach\n28:45 - Camp Cove Beach\n31:24 - Victoria St\n32:06 - Cove St\n35:22 - Cliff St\n38:32 - Military Rd\n41:11 - Gap Bluff Walking Track\n42:10 - The Gap\n43:32 - Avina Lookout\n44:42 - Dunbar''s Anchor\n45:42 - Gap Park\n49:24 - Gap Park\n51:09 - Jacobs Ladder Lookout\n53:43 - Don Ritchie Grove\n56:36 - Gap Rd\n59:37 - Robertson Park\n01:02:56 - Watsons Bay Beach\n01:05:42 - End of Walk at Watsons Bay Baths\n\n#walkingtour #relaxingwalk #videowalk #4kuhd #virtualwalk #binaural  #australia #sydneywalktour #sydneywalk #sydney  #sydneyaustralia #beachwalk #watsonsbay #campcove\n\n\nIG7MQKADLYNFRXJ0","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JgIPCer-OtE/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Beach Walking Tours","channel":"4KWalksAllOver","channelTitle":"4KWalksAllOver","channelId":"UC5ZuNlFvhoK9989OQrlFYBw","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2026-02-15T01:47:39