VALUES (
  'MAhzv8ssLeQ',
  'ETS2 | Chill Morning POV Drive | No Commentary ASMR | 1 Hour | Iveco S-Way',
  'Experience a peaceful 748km journey through the Balkans as the sun rises. Starting at 5:00 AM, this 1-hour drive in the Iveco S-Way captures the transition from the first lights of dawn to a bright morning, enhanced by ultra-realistic rain, weather effects, and high-fidelity engine sounds.

This video is designed for those who seek a high-quality background for studying, working, or simply relaxing. No commentary, just the pure ASMR of the road and the morning atmosphere.

---

🗺️ TRIP INFORMATION
• Truck: Iveco S-Way
• Route: Balkans — Sarajevo ➔ Belgrade
• Distance: 748 km
• Time of Day: 05:00 AM (Sunrise)
• Duration: 1 Hour

---

🕒 VIDEO TIMELINE / CAPTURES
00:00 — Engine Start & Initial Departure
03:10 — Leaving the Logistics Hub & Open Road
08:10 — Entering the City & Urban Driving
13:09 — Highway Entry & Scenic Drive
16:09 — Crossing the Great Bridge & River View
22:45 — Peaceful Countryside & Winding Roads
28:45 — Passing Through a Quiet Village
36:45 — Navigating the Rocky Hillside Pass
39:24 — Rain Begins & Moody Atmosphere
44:34 — Driving Through Heavy Rain & Mountain Mist
48:05 — Approaching the Destination in the Rain
59:35 — Final Stretch & Arrival at the Logistics Center

---
🚛 THE CHILL DRIVER
High-fidelity ETS2 & ATS journeys in a no-commentary format — engineered for sleep, deep focus, and relaxation.
No talking • No music • Just engine, road, and atmosphere. If this format helps you, subscribing supports the channel.

---
📌 PLAYLISTS
• Long Drives: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL0KKkmxWVl5hanMk6RqJQUaWoptSh16p-
• Shorts Collection: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL0KKkmxWVl5i-RDthvm-3nQQTG1REPBmq

---

⚙️ MODS / PRODUCTION
• Engine Sound: Iveco S-Way Reworked Sounds by Kapitan Kriechbaum
🔗 https://sharemods.com/blape0xrylnw/Iveco_SWay_sounds.scs.html
• Graphics: SnowyMoon Graphics Mod — https://snowymoon.io/
• Weather: Weather_3.5.1_4k (Steam Workshop) — https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2914588321
• Rain: Realistic Rain v5.2.1 (Steam Workshop) — https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1787041596

---

💻 PC & GEAR
• Laptop: ASUS TUF F15 Gaming
• GPU: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060
• CPU: 11th Gen Intel Core i5
• RAM: 32 GB DDR5
• Steering Wheel: Thrustmaster T300 RS

---

📧 BUSINESS
For sponsorships or collaborations:
• canustabusiness.61@gmail.com

---

📢 CONNECT WITH ME
• Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/thechilldriver
• TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@thechilldriveryt
• YouTube: @TheChillDriverr

---

⚠️ COPYRIGHT
© The Chill Driver. Please do not re-upload without written permission.

---

